1
00:00:01,153 --> 00:00:05,758
(Who did Dong Young's mother choose?)

2
00:00:08,393 --> 00:00:09,827
Ha Yoon?

3
00:00:09,827 --> 00:00:11,129
Ha Yoon's mother.

4
00:00:11,129 --> 00:00:12,664
(Kim Dong Young's mother
chooses Yang Ha Yoon's mother.)

5
00:00:12,664 --> 00:00:13,765
This is nerve-racking.

6
00:00:13,765 --> 00:00:15,266
(Kim Yo Han, Lee Yo Won, Seo Jang Hoon)

7
00:00:15,266 --> 00:00:16,734
What will they discuss?

8
00:00:17,535 --> 00:00:19,270
Thank you for coming.

9
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:20,605
Of course.

10
00:00:21,706 --> 00:00:23,208
You must be tired.

11
00:00:23,208 --> 00:00:24,409
This has been hard for all of us.

12
00:00:26,277 --> 00:00:27,745
I'm fine.

13
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:31,716
I won't take much of your time.

14
00:00:31,716 --> 00:00:32,984
Yes.

15
00:00:33,585 --> 00:00:37,021
Dong Young likes your daughter so much.

16
00:00:37,021 --> 00:00:40,091
I thought I should say something.

17
00:00:40,091 --> 00:00:41,125
I see.

18
00:00:42,026 --> 00:00:44,629
Even if he has shortcomings,

19
00:00:44,629 --> 00:00:46,331
please think kindly of him.

20
00:00:46,331 --> 00:00:48,499
That's a mother's heart.

21
00:00:48,499 --> 00:00:49,834
That's all I ask.

22
00:00:51,903 --> 00:00:55,440
What do you think of Dong Young?

23
00:00:57,208 --> 00:00:58,276
Well...

24
00:01:00,345 --> 00:01:01,412
Goodness.

25
00:01:04,415 --> 00:01:05,483
This is difficult.

26
00:01:06,517 --> 00:01:10,421
Their circumstances...

27
00:01:10,421 --> 00:01:11,990
need to align too.

28
00:01:12,957 --> 00:01:17,695
Ha Yoon just opened her clinic.

29
00:01:19,430 --> 00:01:21,332
That seems like a major factor too.

30
00:01:23,434 --> 00:01:27,038
Ha Yoon's mother seems
unable to say what she doesn't mean.

31
00:01:27,038 --> 00:01:27,839
I think so too.

32
00:01:29,274 --> 00:01:31,876
There's the distance.

33
00:01:31,876 --> 00:01:35,780
I felt it could be a lot for you, Ms. Kim.

34
00:01:37,682 --> 00:01:39,317
Yes.

35
00:01:39,317 --> 00:01:40,518
This is difficult.

36
00:01:40,518 --> 00:01:41,419
That's right.

37
00:01:41,419 --> 00:01:43,855
Being a mom is hard to the very end.

38
00:01:48,359 --> 00:01:49,994
I wish it could have worked out.

39
00:01:49,994 --> 00:01:51,496
Yes, of course.

40
00:01:53,498 --> 00:01:55,133
I understand what you mean.

41
00:01:57,302 --> 00:01:59,704
I completely understand.

42
00:01:59,704 --> 00:02:00,705
No.

43
00:02:01,773 --> 00:02:04,409
I don't think I have more to say.

44
00:02:05,577 --> 00:02:06,878
Right?

45
00:02:06,878 --> 00:02:08,112
- Yes.
- Yes.

46
00:02:09,480 --> 00:02:10,648
It's heartbreaking.

47
00:02:10,648 --> 00:02:14,152
He likes her enough to be that direct.

48
00:02:14,152 --> 00:02:17,589
If she'd just open her heart a little,

49
00:02:17,589 --> 00:02:19,991
they could go on a few dates.

50
00:02:19,991 --> 00:02:23,995
They could give it more time,

51
00:02:23,995 --> 00:02:26,564
and end it later if it doesn't work.

52
00:02:26,564 --> 00:02:30,201
Isn't she giving up too soon?

53
00:02:30,201 --> 00:02:31,736
That's just my opinion.

54
00:02:34,138 --> 00:02:35,273
It breaks my heart,

55
00:02:36,140 --> 00:02:37,342
but letting this go any further...

56
00:02:37,342 --> 00:02:40,111
would be unfair to the other person.

57
00:02:40,111 --> 00:02:42,580
So I just...

58
00:02:44,382 --> 00:02:46,217
Goodness.

59
00:02:46,217 --> 00:02:47,552
From what I see,

60
00:02:47,552 --> 00:02:49,754
it wouldn't have worked even nearby.

61
00:02:49,754 --> 00:02:53,758
I don't think she liked Dong Young.

62
00:02:53,758 --> 00:02:54,592
Because...

63
00:02:54,592 --> 00:02:58,863
if distance were the only issue,

64
00:02:58,863 --> 00:03:01,599
it wouldn't have ended like this.

65
00:03:03,968 --> 00:03:05,169
Ha Yoon's mom...

66
00:03:07,972 --> 00:03:09,407
said she doesn't think it'll work.

67
00:03:09,407 --> 00:03:11,242
- Why?
- She said she's sorry.

68
00:03:13,111 --> 00:03:14,178
It's just...

69
00:03:16,114 --> 00:03:18,616
Ha Yoon still...

70
00:03:18,616 --> 00:03:21,152
Because she just opened her clinic?

71
00:03:21,152 --> 00:03:24,889
Yes. She thinks that makes it hard.

72
00:03:26,224 --> 00:03:28,126
- So it'd be hard to date?
- Yes.

73
00:03:32,330 --> 00:03:36,200
I'll have to put my hope in Ha Yoon.

74
00:03:38,002 --> 00:03:41,239
(Who did In Kwon's mother choose?)

75
00:03:41,239 --> 00:03:42,707
Wouldn't it be Jeong Yoon?

76
00:03:42,707 --> 00:03:43,741
(Lee In Kwon's mother
chooses Choi Jeong Yoon.)

77
00:03:43,741 --> 00:03:45,376
- Jeong Yoon.
- Hello.

78
00:03:45,376 --> 00:03:47,478
They're all doing this for their sons.

79
00:03:50,114 --> 00:03:51,282
Hello.

80
00:03:51,783 --> 00:03:54,285
Meeting so many people is tiring, right?

81
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:57,889
I do feel a little confused.

82
00:03:57,889 --> 00:04:01,693
This situation is upsetting for me.

83
00:04:01,693 --> 00:04:02,894
I can imagine.

84
00:04:02,894 --> 00:04:04,929
In Kwon said the same thing.

85
00:04:04,929 --> 00:04:06,698
He said you must be struggling.

86
00:04:12,837 --> 00:04:14,372
Poor girl.

87
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:16,975
(Jeong Yoon bursts into tears.)

88
00:04:16,975 --> 00:04:18,009
I'm sorry.

89
00:04:18,009 --> 00:04:19,377
No, it's all right.

90
00:04:21,880 --> 00:04:23,514
It's okay.

91
00:04:24,616 --> 00:04:25,650
Just relax.

92
00:04:27,485 --> 00:04:29,354
I'm having a hard time emotionally.

93
00:04:30,488 --> 00:04:31,489
I'm sorry.

94
00:04:33,858 --> 00:04:35,660
Are you crying because I called you?

95
00:04:35,660 --> 00:04:36,995
No, not at all.

96
00:04:36,995 --> 00:04:38,263
It's not that.

97
00:04:39,330 --> 00:04:43,735
I just feel sorry to all the men...

98
00:04:43,735 --> 00:04:45,803
and to all their mothers too.

99
00:04:45,803 --> 00:04:48,539
I couldn't look at them during dinner.

100
00:04:50,441 --> 00:04:55,613
(Jeong Yoon felt uneasy all dinner.)

101
00:04:57,181 --> 00:05:00,752
(Even during casual greetings,)

102
00:05:00,985 --> 00:05:05,056
(Jeong Yoon felt self-conscious.)

103
00:05:05,957 --> 00:05:08,993
It wasn't what I intended.

104
00:05:10,295 --> 00:05:13,965
They're all such good people.

105
00:05:13,965 --> 00:05:17,936
But I have to judge and choose them.

106
00:05:18,836 --> 00:05:22,340
You don't have to explain that.

107
00:05:22,340 --> 00:05:25,009
You don't need to do that with me.

108
00:05:25,009 --> 00:05:29,747
Just follow your heart until tomorrow.

109
00:05:29,747 --> 00:05:34,018
It won't be easy, but don't feel burdened.

110
00:05:34,319 --> 00:05:39,190
If it isn't right, it isn't meant to be.

111
00:05:39,190 --> 00:05:40,058
So...

112
00:05:40,058 --> 00:05:43,595
Every mother here will understand.

113
00:05:43,595 --> 00:05:45,363
We're all in the same position.

114
00:05:46,064 --> 00:05:48,299
In Kwon's mother is
much better than he is.

115
00:05:48,299 --> 00:05:50,235
I thought so too.

116
00:05:50,235 --> 00:05:53,838
She's so warm and articulate.

117
00:05:53,838 --> 00:05:57,775
She says exactly what is needed.

118
00:05:57,775 --> 00:05:59,744
That must be why Jeong Yoon teared up.

119
00:05:59,744 --> 00:06:01,279
From what I see,

120
00:06:01,279 --> 00:06:04,382
this meeting could give In Kwon...

121
00:06:04,382 --> 00:06:06,784
a huge advantage.

122
00:06:06,784 --> 00:06:07,685
Why?

123
00:06:07,685 --> 00:06:09,621
Tears...

124
00:06:09,621 --> 00:06:11,322
Tears never come
before someone you dislike.

125
00:06:11,322 --> 00:06:16,027
I think he has taken a major lead.

126
00:06:17,028 --> 00:06:20,965
Speaking as In Kwon's mom,

127
00:06:20,965 --> 00:06:26,204
everything he told you was sincere.

128
00:06:26,204 --> 00:06:28,206
Yes, I could really feel that.

129
00:06:28,206 --> 00:06:29,841
That's all.

130
00:06:29,841 --> 00:06:32,844
There's one thing I want to tell you.

131
00:06:32,844 --> 00:06:35,680
I used to work in television,

132
00:06:36,981 --> 00:06:40,118
and I got hurt too,

133
00:06:40,118 --> 00:06:43,187
- so I reluctantly quit.
- I see.

134
00:06:43,187 --> 00:06:46,558
So I honestly never wanted...

135
00:06:46,558 --> 00:06:48,893
to see anyone in that industry again.

136
00:06:48,893 --> 00:06:52,230
If I were to date him,

137
00:06:52,230 --> 00:06:55,700
he's wonderful,

138
00:06:55,700 --> 00:07:00,071
but I felt uneasy about his line of work.

139
00:07:01,406 --> 00:07:03,074
That must have been so hard.

140
00:07:04,175 --> 00:07:05,743
I...

141
00:07:05,743 --> 00:07:09,080
had never considered that.

142
00:07:09,080 --> 00:07:12,750
I thought Jeong Yoon also liked In Kwon.

143
00:07:12,750 --> 00:07:14,552
So I believed they might work out.

144
00:07:14,552 --> 00:07:17,222
Our families even met yesterday.

145
00:07:17,222 --> 00:07:20,491
I'd started putting my feelings aside,

146
00:07:20,491 --> 00:07:24,028
but thought, "Maybe I was wrong."

147
00:07:24,696 --> 00:07:27,899
Jeong Yoon cried when we talked.

148
00:07:28,766 --> 00:07:34,439
She was hurt working in TV years ago.

149
00:07:34,439 --> 00:07:37,442
So she still doesn't have the courage...

150
00:07:37,442 --> 00:07:40,945
to see people in that field.

151
00:07:40,945 --> 00:07:43,514
She said it was her own issue.

152
00:07:44,649 --> 00:07:46,918
After hearing that from my mom,

153
00:07:49,354 --> 00:07:50,321
I started thinking.

154
00:07:51,756 --> 00:07:54,025
She says it's hard, yet I only say I care.

155
00:07:56,361 --> 00:07:57,896
Am I pushing her too much?

156
00:08:01,432 --> 00:08:02,467
To be completely honest,

157
00:08:03,434 --> 00:08:04,502
it's 60-40.

158
00:08:05,503 --> 00:08:07,505
Sixty says not to choose her,

159
00:08:08,106 --> 00:08:12,510
and 40 says to see this through.

160
00:08:14,812 --> 00:08:16,014
That's Jeong Yoon's mother.

161
00:08:17,348 --> 00:08:20,618
I'm truly most curious about her choice.

162
00:08:20,618 --> 00:08:22,720
It won't be Seong Mo.

163
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:25,590
Right. She said
she didn't want to talk to him.

164
00:08:25,590 --> 00:08:28,259
- So it's either Ye Chan or In Kwon.
- Ye Chan?

165
00:08:28,259 --> 00:08:31,062
It must be one of those two.

166
00:08:34,065 --> 00:08:35,199
That's unexpected.

167
00:08:35,199 --> 00:08:37,001
See? I said it'd be Ye Chan.

168
00:08:37,001 --> 00:08:38,169
That's completely unexpected.

169
00:08:38,169 --> 00:08:39,270
Hello, Ms. Go.

170
00:08:41,406 --> 00:08:43,041
Have you been waiting long?

171
00:08:43,041 --> 00:08:43,942
Not at all.

172
00:08:44,909 --> 00:08:46,878
(Cough)

173
00:08:46,878 --> 00:08:48,213
- I'm sorry.
- It went down wrong.

174
00:08:50,081 --> 00:08:51,115
He must be nervous.

175
00:08:52,584 --> 00:08:53,518
(Cough)

176
00:08:54,452 --> 00:08:56,321
Something isn't working right.

177
00:08:57,455 --> 00:08:59,290
Sorry. It went down the wrong pipe.

178
00:08:59,290 --> 00:09:00,425
It's all right.

179
00:09:01,292 --> 00:09:02,827
Yesterday, I was so...

180
00:09:03,294 --> 00:09:04,896
unprepared and flustered when we met.

181
00:09:04,896 --> 00:09:06,464
That's all right.

182
00:09:06,464 --> 00:09:07,799
I wanted to see you again.

183
00:09:07,799 --> 00:09:09,300
Yes, thank you.

184
00:09:11,436 --> 00:09:13,071
(Gulp)

185
00:09:13,938 --> 00:09:15,840
As for religion,

186
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:17,842
you can make an effort, right?

187
00:09:17,842 --> 00:09:19,644
You can make an effort,

188
00:09:19,644 --> 00:09:22,881
but we can't know how satisfactory...

189
00:09:22,881 --> 00:09:25,917
- the outcome will be.
- That's right.

190
00:09:25,917 --> 00:09:28,519
What do you think about that?

191
00:09:29,821 --> 00:09:31,522
Regarding religion,

192
00:09:32,323 --> 00:09:34,692
one thing I can promise is...

193
00:09:36,027 --> 00:09:40,498
it will never hold back...

194
00:09:40,498 --> 00:09:42,533
our relationship or become pressure.

195
00:09:42,533 --> 00:09:45,603
She won't feel forced. I can assure you.

196
00:09:45,603 --> 00:09:47,939
If you don't force it,

197
00:09:47,939 --> 00:09:49,440
I think it'll be fine.

198
00:09:51,476 --> 00:09:54,445
When I first walked in,

199
00:09:54,445 --> 00:09:57,482
you looked much more worried than now.

200
00:09:57,482 --> 00:09:59,350
I feel much more at ease now.

201
00:09:59,350 --> 00:10:00,919
I was so conflicted before coming out.

202
00:10:00,919 --> 00:10:02,620
I see.

203
00:10:02,620 --> 00:10:05,623
I wasn't thinking of questions to ask.

204
00:10:06,524 --> 00:10:09,127
I thought I should be fair.

205
00:10:09,127 --> 00:10:12,030
- To all three men?
- Yes.

206
00:10:12,030 --> 00:10:15,533
Should I give them equal time to talk?

207
00:10:15,533 --> 00:10:18,570
That's what I was debating.

208
00:10:19,137 --> 00:10:22,473
But she wasn't fair to Seong Mo.

209
00:10:22,473 --> 00:10:23,474
That was the result of her deliberation.

210
00:10:23,474 --> 00:10:26,244
She said she wouldn't meet him at all.

211
00:10:26,477 --> 00:10:27,745
Besides me,

212
00:10:27,745 --> 00:10:31,382
she could choose Seong Mo or In Kwon.

213
00:10:31,382 --> 00:10:32,984
The fact that she chose me...

214
00:10:32,984 --> 00:10:34,752
means she was most curious about me.

215
00:10:35,353 --> 00:10:38,323
Or perhaps the good impression I made...

216
00:10:38,323 --> 00:10:40,558
on her early on mattered more.

217
00:10:41,726 --> 00:10:44,028
You talked to Ye Chan?

218
00:10:44,028 --> 00:10:45,163
Why did you do that?

219
00:10:45,563 --> 00:10:47,432
I told you to consider Seong Mo.

220
00:10:49,234 --> 00:10:50,268
What's going on?

221
00:10:50,935 --> 00:10:52,003
Wait!

222
00:10:52,737 --> 00:10:54,973
Something just occurred to me.

223
00:10:54,973 --> 00:10:55,940
What?

224
00:10:55,940 --> 00:10:58,309
She's the one who mentioned dopamine.

225
00:10:58,576 --> 00:10:59,944
For me, dopamine.

226
00:10:59,944 --> 00:11:02,180
I need dopamine to know it's love.

227
00:11:03,081 --> 00:11:03,815
That's right.

228
00:11:03,815 --> 00:11:05,250
If it's her,

229
00:11:05,250 --> 00:11:09,320
she may seek dopamine with Seong Mo.

230
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:11,623
I loved seeing her with Seong Mo.

231
00:11:11,623 --> 00:11:14,158
She might choose him. That just hit me.

232
00:11:14,158 --> 00:11:16,494
They had the best chemistry, right?

233
00:11:16,828 --> 00:11:18,596
I told you to consider Seong Mo.

234
00:11:22,533 --> 00:11:23,434
What did he say?

235
00:11:24,869 --> 00:11:26,704
I don't know. My head hurts.

236
00:11:26,704 --> 00:11:28,406
Why won't you tell me?

237
00:11:29,507 --> 00:11:31,309
Who did you meet?

238
00:11:31,309 --> 00:11:32,744
No, you tell me first.

239
00:11:33,711 --> 00:11:36,447
Nothing happened to upset you, right?

240
00:11:36,447 --> 00:11:37,515
No.

241
00:11:37,515 --> 00:11:39,584
I'm just tired. That's all.

242
00:11:39,918 --> 00:11:41,920
You didn't ask about faith, did you?

243
00:11:42,253 --> 00:11:43,521
I did.

244
00:11:43,521 --> 00:11:45,657
He said having his own faith...

245
00:11:45,657 --> 00:11:47,792
doesn't mean he should force it on you.

246
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:53,197
Considering all the practical factors,

247
00:11:53,197 --> 00:11:55,967
he was the one with no major concerns.

248
00:11:55,967 --> 00:11:58,770
I could naturally picture dating him...

249
00:11:58,770 --> 00:12:00,705
once we left here.

250
00:12:00,705 --> 00:12:03,374
At first, that was Ye Chan.

251
00:12:05,243 --> 00:12:06,711
But I...

252
00:12:06,711 --> 00:12:08,713
cannot ignore that issue.

253
00:12:08,713 --> 00:12:09,414
What issue?

254
00:12:09,414 --> 00:12:12,016
That family wants
a Christian daughter-in-law.

255
00:12:12,016 --> 00:12:15,486
That's why she stayed with Da Hye
and her mother until 2 a.m.

256
00:12:16,588 --> 00:12:18,089
Da Hye's mom told me earlier.

257
00:12:18,089 --> 00:12:20,992
They connected so well over religion.

258
00:12:21,292 --> 00:12:24,996
So Da Hye doesn't want
to see Shin Woo now.

259
00:12:25,530 --> 00:12:28,199
She wants to marry into that family.

260
00:12:28,967 --> 00:12:31,903
Da Hye's mom told me too.

261
00:12:31,903 --> 00:12:32,937
What did she say?

262
00:12:32,937 --> 00:12:36,975
Even if he says it's fine,

263
00:12:36,975 --> 00:12:38,943
it won't work if his parents are devout.

264
00:12:38,943 --> 00:12:40,178
"Make her give up."

265
00:12:40,945 --> 00:12:42,213
It won't be easy.

266
00:12:42,213 --> 00:12:45,650
A nonbeliever entering
a Christian family is even harder.

267
00:12:45,650 --> 00:12:46,951
Seriously hard.

268
00:12:47,652 --> 00:12:49,454
Nonbelievers don't understand.

269
00:12:51,656 --> 00:12:52,657
That's what I'm saying.

270
00:12:53,324 --> 00:12:56,227
She seems to want you to stop me.

271
00:12:56,227 --> 00:13:00,498
Da Hye's mother completely...

272
00:13:00,498 --> 00:13:05,169
changed Jeong Yoon's mom's mind.

273
00:13:05,169 --> 00:13:06,871
That remark changed the whole game.

274
00:13:06,871 --> 00:13:09,541
Jeong Yoon's mother is worried.

275
00:13:09,541 --> 00:13:11,342
What if her daughter joins that family...

276
00:13:11,342 --> 00:13:15,380
and conflicts arise over religion?

277
00:13:15,380 --> 00:13:16,748
She worries her daughter will suffer.

278
00:13:16,748 --> 00:13:19,317
That's likely why she met him again...

279
00:13:19,317 --> 00:13:21,386
and asked him about it once more.

280
00:13:22,287 --> 00:13:27,225
(Who did Ye Chan's mother choose?)

281
00:13:27,625 --> 00:13:28,693
Isn't it Jeong Yoon?

282
00:13:32,797 --> 00:13:33,831
(Kwon Ye Chan's mother
chooses Ahn Do Yoon.)

283
00:13:33,831 --> 00:13:36,701
- Hello.
- She called for Do Yoon.

284
00:13:36,701 --> 00:13:37,902
Why all of a sudden?

285
00:13:40,204 --> 00:13:42,340
- You didn't know, right?
- I didn't.

286
00:13:42,340 --> 00:13:43,474
I had no idea.

287
00:13:43,474 --> 00:13:45,310
Then how did you know to come?

288
00:13:45,310 --> 00:13:47,679
- They said there was a meeting?
- Yes.

289
00:13:47,679 --> 00:13:48,846
Really?

290
00:13:48,846 --> 00:13:50,381
(Startled)

291
00:13:50,381 --> 00:13:52,450
Our families met yesterday, right?

292
00:13:52,450 --> 00:13:53,952
After that meeting,

293
00:13:53,952 --> 00:13:55,587
I honestly loved everything.

294
00:13:56,221 --> 00:13:58,356
She seems to have left that meeting...

295
00:13:58,356 --> 00:14:00,024
with a wonderful impression.

296
00:14:00,024 --> 00:14:01,159
I really loved it,

297
00:14:01,159 --> 00:14:04,062
and I liked you even more afterward.

298
00:14:04,062 --> 00:14:05,763
- Really?
- Yes, after the meeting.

299
00:14:05,763 --> 00:14:06,731
Thank you.

300
00:14:06,731 --> 00:14:09,467
I wanted our families to become in-laws.

301
00:14:09,467 --> 00:14:11,736
- Really?
- That's how I felt.

302
00:14:11,736 --> 00:14:13,238
I truly felt that way yesterday.

303
00:14:13,238 --> 00:14:16,374
I still feel that way.

304
00:14:16,374 --> 00:14:19,611
So I subtly asked Ye Chan last night.

305
00:14:19,611 --> 00:14:24,582
He wouldn't give me a definite answer.

306
00:14:24,582 --> 00:14:25,783
Really?

307
00:14:25,783 --> 00:14:29,187
I was certain Ye Chan...

308
00:14:29,187 --> 00:14:31,055
had chosen Jeong Yoon.

309
00:14:33,124 --> 00:14:34,926
- Didn't he?
- I don't think so.

310
00:14:36,527 --> 00:14:37,528
I had no idea.

311
00:14:38,897 --> 00:14:41,866
I thought he was fully leaning her way.

312
00:14:41,866 --> 00:14:44,068
Why? Ye Chan had...

313
00:14:44,435 --> 00:14:46,271
three women at one point.

314
00:14:46,271 --> 00:14:48,406
Then it became two,

315
00:14:48,406 --> 00:14:52,176
and sometimes Jeong Yoon wasn't one.

316
00:14:52,176 --> 00:14:53,411
Really?

317
00:14:54,345 --> 00:14:56,447
That's what I know, but I'm not sure.

318
00:14:56,447 --> 00:15:00,151
I'm very perceptive. My guess is that.

319
00:15:00,151 --> 00:15:02,453
I'm not sure she's that perceptive.

320
00:15:02,854 --> 00:15:04,689
Another misunderstanding arises.

321
00:15:04,689 --> 00:15:05,990
(Another mix-up on the final night)

322
00:15:05,990 --> 00:15:07,959
This could confuse many people.

323
00:15:07,959 --> 00:15:11,329
His mother could confuse many people.

324
00:15:11,329 --> 00:15:13,398
Do Yoon looks very confused right now.

325
00:15:13,398 --> 00:15:15,733
She may not know how her son feels.

326
00:15:16,434 --> 00:15:18,202
I want to know how you feel.

327
00:15:18,202 --> 00:15:19,404
How I feel?

328
00:15:19,404 --> 00:15:21,339
How do you feel today?

329
00:15:21,339 --> 00:15:22,974
In my opinion,

330
00:15:22,974 --> 00:15:25,043
I thought he'd definitely chosen her.

331
00:15:26,244 --> 00:15:28,713
Maybe not. It's only my guess.

332
00:15:28,713 --> 00:15:29,948
- It's a guess.
- Right.

333
00:15:29,948 --> 00:15:31,382
I don't know exactly how Ye Chan feels,

334
00:15:31,382 --> 00:15:34,285
but I heard his interest in you...

335
00:15:34,285 --> 00:15:36,421
- kept growing.
- Really?

336
00:15:36,421 --> 00:15:37,822
She's spreading false rumors.

337
00:15:38,656 --> 00:15:39,924
Ma'am.

338
00:15:39,924 --> 00:15:42,760
She must not want to lose her.

339
00:15:42,760 --> 00:15:45,630
Then what was that visit to Da Hye's?

340
00:15:45,630 --> 00:15:46,998
She was there with them...

341
00:15:46,998 --> 00:15:51,536
saying, "Let's do it, us believers."

342
00:15:51,536 --> 00:15:53,905
Then she suddenly came over here.

343
00:15:54,405 --> 00:15:56,040
I don't know how he'll feel tomorrow...

344
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:58,176
after sleeping on it.

345
00:15:58,176 --> 00:15:59,978
But right now,

346
00:15:59,978 --> 00:16:00,945
- no.
- Really?

347
00:16:00,945 --> 00:16:02,513
At this point, it isn't her.

348
00:16:02,513 --> 00:16:03,915
I honestly had no idea.

349
00:16:03,915 --> 00:16:05,483
I don't think it's her.

350
00:16:05,483 --> 00:16:07,886
That's my sense. He hasn't told me.

351
00:16:08,887 --> 00:16:10,421
I'll think about it too.

352
00:16:10,421 --> 00:16:13,391
I'll think about what to do with Ye Chan.

353
00:16:14,792 --> 00:16:17,462
Thank you for thinking so highly of me.

354
00:16:17,462 --> 00:16:18,897
It's not just that I think highly of you.

355
00:16:18,897 --> 00:16:20,798
You're truly adorable.

356
00:16:20,798 --> 00:16:22,400
It isn't over until it's over.

357
00:16:22,400 --> 00:16:24,269
It isn't even 10 p.m.

358
00:16:24,269 --> 00:16:25,670
We've gone to bed at 2 a.m. every day.

359
00:16:26,371 --> 00:16:27,405
(Adorable)

360
00:16:27,405 --> 00:16:28,940
Thank you so much.

361
00:16:28,940 --> 00:16:30,108
Really.

362
00:16:30,108 --> 00:16:32,744
At the family meeting, you felt like...

363
00:16:32,744 --> 00:16:34,913
a second mother to me.

364
00:16:34,913 --> 00:16:38,283
I feel closest to you after my own mom.

365
00:16:38,283 --> 00:16:40,151
Of all the mothers here.

366
00:16:40,151 --> 00:16:42,053
We ate together,

367
00:16:42,053 --> 00:16:44,222
and I even met your younger sister.

368
00:16:44,222 --> 00:16:45,490
(A new mother and daughter are born.)

369
00:16:46,925 --> 00:16:48,960
I feel bad for Do Yoon.

370
00:16:49,227 --> 00:16:53,164
She had nearly settled on In Kwon.

371
00:16:53,164 --> 00:16:54,032
Exactly.

372
00:16:54,032 --> 00:16:56,768
She kept hearing that she's too young...

373
00:16:56,768 --> 00:16:58,269
and cried.

374
00:16:58,269 --> 00:17:00,138
She was finally relieved...

375
00:17:00,138 --> 00:17:03,775
and ready to eat and go home tomorrow.

376
00:17:03,775 --> 00:17:05,376
Then suddenly...

377
00:17:05,376 --> 00:17:08,446
Ye Chan's mother made a bold move.

378
00:17:08,446 --> 00:17:09,614
What a situation.

379
00:17:10,848 --> 00:17:13,351
Mom! Ye Chan's mom...

380
00:17:14,619 --> 00:17:16,054
came to talk to me.

381
00:17:16,054 --> 00:17:18,990
She says he hasn't chosen Jeong Yoon.

382
00:17:18,990 --> 00:17:20,391
It isn't final.

383
00:17:20,391 --> 00:17:21,759
That's only what we assumed.

384
00:17:21,759 --> 00:17:22,594
No, seriously.

385
00:17:22,594 --> 00:17:24,395
So I'm going to talk to Ye Chan now.

386
00:17:24,395 --> 00:17:25,263
What will you say?

387
00:17:25,263 --> 00:17:26,698
That I'm making him my first choice.

388
00:17:27,498 --> 00:17:28,399
I'm choosing him.

389
00:17:28,399 --> 00:17:30,101
I'm serious.

390
00:17:30,535 --> 00:17:33,438
They say everyone keeps changing sides.

391
00:17:33,438 --> 00:17:34,572
This place is unbelievable.

392
00:17:34,572 --> 00:17:35,974
People are changing their minds again.

393
00:17:35,974 --> 00:17:38,176
I was going to turn off the light
and go to bed, but no.

394
00:17:38,910 --> 00:17:40,812
I should try all I can.

395
00:17:40,812 --> 00:17:42,046
I've changed my mind too.

396
00:17:42,714 --> 00:17:44,115
She's still...

397
00:17:44,115 --> 00:17:47,785
young.

398
00:17:47,785 --> 00:17:49,454
She's adorable.

399
00:17:49,454 --> 00:17:50,755
She heard that one little thing...

400
00:17:50,755 --> 00:17:53,191
and said, "I'm going right now."

401
00:17:53,191 --> 00:17:55,226
Tell him to give you a clear answer.

402
00:17:55,226 --> 00:17:56,794
That's what everyone dislikes.

403
00:17:56,794 --> 00:17:58,930
He's popular,

404
00:17:58,930 --> 00:18:01,399
and they want a clear answer from him.

405
00:18:01,399 --> 00:18:03,935
I guess he didn't answer clearly.

406
00:18:03,935 --> 00:18:05,970
So...

407
00:18:05,970 --> 00:18:07,972
hear him out and decide for yourself.

408
00:18:08,673 --> 00:18:10,308
I should act a little aloof.

409
00:18:11,743 --> 00:18:12,844
I should wear this.

410
00:18:14,045 --> 00:18:15,113
Silk.

411
00:18:15,113 --> 00:18:16,180
Silk.

412
00:18:16,180 --> 00:18:18,283
Goodness. She's excited.

413
00:18:18,983 --> 00:18:20,919
Or is this too much?

414
00:18:22,120 --> 00:18:24,055
- We should iron it.
- Exactly.

415
00:18:24,956 --> 00:18:26,457
Why would you iron it?

416
00:18:26,457 --> 00:18:27,625
You're even going to iron it?

417
00:18:28,593 --> 00:18:30,161
(Mom irons for her daughter's last try.)

418
00:18:30,161 --> 00:18:33,364
Her mother cheers her on to the end.

419
00:18:33,698 --> 00:18:35,366
I should try all I can.

420
00:18:37,035 --> 00:18:40,305
(Aloof Do Yoon heads out.)

421
00:18:41,039 --> 00:18:42,106
Anyone there?

422
00:18:43,141 --> 00:18:44,042
Yes?

423
00:18:44,042 --> 00:18:45,710
- Ms. Kim.
- Yes?

424
00:18:45,710 --> 00:18:47,378
Is Ye Chan here?

425
00:18:47,378 --> 00:18:48,346
Goodness.

426
00:18:48,346 --> 00:18:50,114
He just left to see you.

427
00:18:50,114 --> 00:18:51,149
Really?

428
00:18:52,483 --> 00:18:54,452
Honestly, I was grateful to Do Yoon.

429
00:18:54,452 --> 00:18:56,988
She chose you and said she likes you more.

430
00:18:56,988 --> 00:18:58,423
I'm grateful for that.

431
00:18:58,423 --> 00:19:00,925
As we talk,

432
00:19:00,925 --> 00:19:03,127
I feel like
maybe I should speak to Do Yoon again.

433
00:19:03,628 --> 00:19:04,529
I'll be back.

434
00:19:04,529 --> 00:19:07,599
At least have a quick talk with her.

435
00:19:09,133 --> 00:19:10,902
This...

436
00:19:10,902 --> 00:19:12,403
This mother and son...

437
00:19:13,371 --> 00:19:15,306
keep going back and forth.

438
00:19:15,306 --> 00:19:16,407
Back and forth.

439
00:19:16,407 --> 00:19:19,477
It's the last day. What will he do?

440
00:19:20,411 --> 00:19:22,680
I'll hurry. Ms. Kim,

441
00:19:23,014 --> 00:19:25,717
do I look nice?
It's what I wore at the meeting.

442
00:19:25,717 --> 00:19:26,784
You look nice.

443
00:19:28,052 --> 00:19:30,788
(She shows off her outfit and leaves.)

444
00:19:32,023 --> 00:19:33,157
Anyone there?

445
00:19:33,157 --> 00:19:34,058
Yes?

446
00:19:35,693 --> 00:19:36,628
Who is it?

447
00:19:37,428 --> 00:19:39,097
Excuse me, is...

448
00:19:39,097 --> 00:19:41,566
That sounds like Da Hye's mother.

449
00:19:43,101 --> 00:19:45,336
Ye Chan, come in.

450
00:19:45,336 --> 00:19:47,839
- My goodness.
- "Come in."

451
00:19:47,839 --> 00:19:49,541
- "Come in."
- What do we do?

452
00:19:49,541 --> 00:19:52,911
This is exciting at the very end.

453
00:19:53,244 --> 00:19:55,947
Is Do Yoon here?

454
00:19:56,481 --> 00:19:58,316
- Do Yoon? I haven't seen her.
- No?

455
00:19:58,316 --> 00:20:00,018
- They use the next room.
- I see.

456
00:20:00,018 --> 00:20:01,686
I'll see you later.

457
00:20:01,686 --> 00:20:02,787
Talk to Da Hye for a moment.

458
00:20:02,787 --> 00:20:04,889
- All right.
- Thank you.

459
00:20:04,889 --> 00:20:08,126
(Ye Chan hurriedly turns back.)

460
00:20:10,094 --> 00:20:11,529
(They miss, then run into each other.)

461
00:20:11,529 --> 00:20:12,363
Hi.

462
00:20:12,697 --> 00:20:14,132
Did you change clothes again?

463
00:20:15,233 --> 00:20:16,434
Were you wearing that earlier?

464
00:20:16,434 --> 00:20:18,536
- No, I changed.
- I thought so.

465
00:20:18,903 --> 00:20:20,672
"I changed to impress you."

466
00:20:21,773 --> 00:20:25,410
(Ye Chan and Do Yoon move to talk.)

467
00:20:29,480 --> 00:20:30,748
Should we get some water first?

468
00:20:30,748 --> 00:20:32,350
Yes. Make mine with big ice cubes.

469
00:20:33,184 --> 00:20:34,219
Big ice cubes?

470
00:20:35,787 --> 00:20:36,788
That's how it's set up.

471
00:20:38,423 --> 00:20:39,457
That's easy and convenient.

472
00:20:43,494 --> 00:20:44,829
(Ye Chan gets Do Yoon ice water first.)

473
00:20:44,829 --> 00:20:45,797
Thank you.

474
00:20:52,270 --> 00:20:53,471
How are you feeling?

475
00:20:54,205 --> 00:20:55,206
How am I feeling?

476
00:20:55,206 --> 00:20:56,174
Are you...

477
00:20:56,174 --> 00:20:57,876
still feeling torn?

478
00:20:57,876 --> 00:21:00,044
Or are your thoughts coming together?

479
00:21:00,044 --> 00:21:02,914
I was choosing between two men.

480
00:21:02,914 --> 00:21:04,716
I'll tell you everything now.

481
00:21:04,716 --> 00:21:07,051
It was between In Kwon and you.

482
00:21:07,051 --> 00:21:10,555
That's why I chose you
for the family meeting.

483
00:21:10,889 --> 00:21:13,591
But you chose her for the free date,

484
00:21:13,591 --> 00:21:15,326
and then you said that to me.

485
00:21:15,326 --> 00:21:20,832
So I thought you'd settled on her.

486
00:21:20,832 --> 00:21:22,867
From my perspective,

487
00:21:22,867 --> 00:21:25,904
even after the family meeting,

488
00:21:25,904 --> 00:21:29,941
I often said you seemed even better.

489
00:21:29,941 --> 00:21:31,676
I had no idea.

490
00:21:31,676 --> 00:21:33,177
I said it often.

491
00:21:33,411 --> 00:21:36,614
I was about 80 percent certain,

492
00:21:38,816 --> 00:21:40,151
but I still don't know.

493
00:21:41,419 --> 00:21:42,287
Goodness.

494
00:21:42,987 --> 00:21:44,122
Stop saying you don't know.

495
00:21:45,323 --> 00:21:46,424
Enough already.

496
00:21:47,992 --> 00:21:49,093
What don't you know?

497
00:21:51,029 --> 00:21:54,165
To put it simply,

498
00:21:54,165 --> 00:21:56,668
it's between you and Jeong Yoon.

499
00:21:57,368 --> 00:21:59,737
Will I choose one of them or not?

500
00:22:01,139 --> 00:22:03,107
I see.

501
00:22:03,975 --> 00:22:06,110
I don't even know how to explain this.

502
00:22:06,110 --> 00:22:07,612
(Ye Chan is unsure until the last day.)

503
00:22:07,612 --> 00:22:09,581
That's simply what I think right now.

504
00:22:09,581 --> 00:22:12,183
You chose someone but may not act?

505
00:22:12,951 --> 00:22:13,851
Yes.

506
00:22:13,851 --> 00:22:15,853
- Really?
- Whether to choose anyone.

507
00:22:16,921 --> 00:22:21,593
He wants Jeong Yoon but lacks certainty.

508
00:22:21,593 --> 00:22:22,360
That's right.

509
00:22:22,360 --> 00:22:25,496
He named Do Yoon and Jeong Yoon,

510
00:22:25,496 --> 00:22:28,266
but if Jeong Yoon gives him any signal,

511
00:22:28,266 --> 00:22:29,534
- he'll pick her at once.
- Right.

512
00:22:29,534 --> 00:22:31,269
That's why he's torn between them.

513
00:22:31,269 --> 00:22:32,604
That's right.

514
00:22:33,104 --> 00:22:34,439
Then do whatever you want.

515
00:22:35,573 --> 00:22:36,908
Do as you please.

516
00:22:39,043 --> 00:22:41,246
I'll make my case.

517
00:22:42,513 --> 00:22:44,682
All of a sudden?

518
00:22:45,250 --> 00:22:47,218
That's bold.

519
00:22:47,218 --> 00:22:49,320
That's how direct she should be.

520
00:22:50,421 --> 00:22:51,489
First, I'm young.

521
00:22:54,092 --> 00:22:56,094
You changed modes overnight.

522
00:22:56,094 --> 00:22:57,195
Did I?

523
00:22:57,195 --> 00:22:59,364
First, I'm young and pretty,

524
00:22:59,364 --> 00:23:00,431
and I make good money.

525
00:23:01,099 --> 00:23:03,301
First, I'm young and pretty,

526
00:23:03,301 --> 00:23:04,369
and I make good money.

527
00:23:04,369 --> 00:23:05,603
I see.

528
00:23:06,704 --> 00:23:07,972
So think about it.

529
00:23:10,341 --> 00:23:12,510
- Did that backfire?
- No, it didn't.

530
00:23:14,045 --> 00:23:15,446
Honestly, I also...

531
00:23:15,446 --> 00:23:18,850
Her face got bright red as she said it.

532
00:23:18,850 --> 00:23:20,318
But honestly,

533
00:23:20,318 --> 00:23:23,555
her relative youth...

534
00:23:24,222 --> 00:23:26,991
- is an advantage.
- It is.

535
00:23:26,991 --> 00:23:29,627
That's an advantage she can highlight.

536
00:23:29,627 --> 00:23:31,129
That's right. She made her case well.

537
00:23:32,664 --> 00:23:33,965
Follow your heart.

538
00:23:36,868 --> 00:23:39,537
I need to think until tomorrow morning,

539
00:23:40,505 --> 00:23:41,739
then make a firm decision.

540
00:23:43,341 --> 00:23:44,409
Then I'll think about it too.

541
00:23:46,644 --> 00:23:47,979
She said she was young, pretty,

542
00:23:47,979 --> 00:23:50,014
and made good money.

543
00:23:50,014 --> 00:23:52,350
I found that side of her charming too.

544
00:23:52,350 --> 00:23:55,253
It made me want to think a little more.

545
00:23:55,787 --> 00:24:00,825
I haven't made up my mind completely.

546
00:24:00,825 --> 00:24:02,594
I think I need more time.

547
00:24:05,630 --> 00:24:07,131
Is Seong Mo here?

548
00:24:07,131 --> 00:24:08,099
(Jeong Yoon comes to see Seong Mo.)

549
00:24:08,099 --> 00:24:09,200
Is he here?

550
00:24:10,034 --> 00:24:11,769
An unexpected contender.

551
00:24:12,437 --> 00:24:13,638
You startled me.

552
00:24:13,638 --> 00:24:14,572
Why are you so surprised?

553
00:24:14,572 --> 00:24:16,741
You said we'd talk for 30 minutes.

554
00:24:17,575 --> 00:24:19,911
That's flashy. What's all this?

555
00:24:19,911 --> 00:24:20,678
Exactly.

556
00:24:20,678 --> 00:24:22,747
- Let's talk after dinner.
- Sure.

557
00:24:23,982 --> 00:24:25,016
Just 30 minutes.

558
00:24:25,016 --> 00:24:26,351
Thirty minutes. Okay.

559
00:24:27,318 --> 00:24:30,822
What did you plan to discuss
for 30 minutes?

560
00:24:30,822 --> 00:24:32,924
You must have had something to say.

561
00:24:32,924 --> 00:24:33,858
That's right.

562
00:24:34,893 --> 00:24:37,195
My mom said this to me.

563
00:24:38,429 --> 00:24:40,598
In Kwon and Jeong Yoon are connecting.

564
00:24:40,598 --> 00:24:45,637
Why squeeze yourself into that gap?

565
00:24:46,871 --> 00:24:49,841
She told me to let you go gracefully.

566
00:24:49,841 --> 00:24:53,044
So then,

567
00:24:53,044 --> 00:24:57,015
I wondered who your mother would choose.

568
00:24:57,015 --> 00:25:00,251
I assumed she'd choose In Kwon to talk to.

569
00:25:00,251 --> 00:25:03,855
Still, I found myself
thinking it over once more.

570
00:25:03,855 --> 00:25:05,590
It wasn't In Kwon.

571
00:25:05,590 --> 00:25:07,692
She originally considered talking to you.

572
00:25:07,692 --> 00:25:08,560
Really?

573
00:25:08,560 --> 00:25:10,395
Yes. I recommended you to my mom.

574
00:25:10,395 --> 00:25:13,131
I wanted her to talk to you once.

575
00:25:13,131 --> 00:25:15,600
You're completely different...

576
00:25:15,600 --> 00:25:16,668
once someone actually talks to you.

577
00:25:17,769 --> 00:25:19,270
I realized that myself.

578
00:25:20,805 --> 00:25:21,706
Anyway,

579
00:25:22,674 --> 00:25:25,176
that's a total misunderstanding.

580
00:25:26,177 --> 00:25:29,981
Why do men decide without even asking?

581
00:25:30,848 --> 00:25:33,618
After my mom said that,

582
00:25:35,887 --> 00:25:37,689
I felt like I couldn't take a hint.

583
00:25:38,790 --> 00:25:41,426
No, that isn't true at all.

584
00:25:43,394 --> 00:25:45,863
Today's date gave me a lot to consider.

585
00:25:47,398 --> 00:25:49,133
I said this on our date.

586
00:25:49,133 --> 00:25:52,270
I wish we'd dated once or twice...

587
00:25:54,739 --> 00:25:55,773
a little earlier.

588
00:25:56,774 --> 00:25:59,644
In the interview, they asked me
to name my top choice.

589
00:25:59,644 --> 00:26:01,246
It was always you.

590
00:26:01,246 --> 00:26:02,413
I think it was you all five days.

591
00:26:02,413 --> 00:26:03,781
Really?

592
00:26:03,781 --> 00:26:05,483
I'll check later.

593
00:26:05,483 --> 00:26:06,417
All five days.

594
00:26:08,887 --> 00:26:10,221
You're funny.

595
00:26:10,855 --> 00:26:12,190
Everything he says makes her laugh.

596
00:26:12,190 --> 00:26:13,958
Since that first norigae vote.

597
00:26:13,958 --> 00:26:15,059
Really?

598
00:26:15,059 --> 00:26:17,128
It was you from the very beginning.

599
00:26:18,396 --> 00:26:21,132
Seong Mo took a step forward...

600
00:26:21,132 --> 00:26:23,368
to build a better connection.

601
00:26:23,935 --> 00:26:27,605
Based on our talks and time together,

602
00:26:27,605 --> 00:26:29,207
I'll try to make...

603
00:26:29,207 --> 00:26:31,910
the most rational choice possible.

604
00:26:32,443 --> 00:26:34,012
I don't know how Jeong Yoon feels.

605
00:26:34,012 --> 00:26:35,146
I really have no idea.

606
00:26:35,146 --> 00:26:37,615
I can't predict her at all.

607
00:26:40,084 --> 00:26:44,589
(In Kwon paces near Jeong Yoon's lodging.)

608
00:26:47,392 --> 00:26:48,259
What a surprise.

609
00:26:49,060 --> 00:26:50,428
It's you, In Kwon.

610
00:26:52,030 --> 00:26:52,864
Who is it?

611
00:26:52,864 --> 00:26:53,798
It's Da Hye.

612
00:26:55,867 --> 00:27:00,104
Why did you suddenly lower your guard?

613
00:27:00,104 --> 00:27:04,809
I can't face Shin Woo anymore.

614
00:27:04,809 --> 00:27:06,010
I thought it might be him.

615
00:27:06,010 --> 00:27:08,112
If it was, I was going to turn around.

616
00:27:08,112 --> 00:27:10,949
The lights kept me from seeing.

617
00:27:11,716 --> 00:27:13,451
It's been tough.

618
00:27:14,586 --> 00:27:16,287
- Can we talk for a moment?
- Sure.

619
00:27:16,287 --> 00:27:17,555
Is it okay to talk out here?

620
00:27:17,555 --> 00:27:18,523
Aren't you cold?

621
00:27:18,523 --> 00:27:19,524
I'm fine.

622
00:27:19,524 --> 00:27:22,093
I have lots of muscle, so I stay warm.

623
00:27:23,728 --> 00:27:27,398
Were you headed to Jeong Yoon's earlier?

624
00:27:27,732 --> 00:27:29,133
I spoke to my mom earlier,

625
00:27:29,133 --> 00:27:31,402
and she said Jeong Yoon cried
talking with my mom.

626
00:27:31,402 --> 00:27:32,670
With your mother?

627
00:27:33,204 --> 00:27:34,439
Go see her.

628
00:27:35,106 --> 00:27:36,774
She may want to be alone.

629
00:27:38,509 --> 00:27:40,211
I didn't realize...

630
00:27:41,312 --> 00:27:43,815
that I talked to Jeong Yoon so much...

631
00:27:43,815 --> 00:27:46,150
that I was blocking her.

632
00:27:46,885 --> 00:27:48,119
Blocking Jeong Yoon?

633
00:27:48,119 --> 00:27:49,554
Yes, keeping other men away.

634
00:27:50,421 --> 00:27:52,090
That weighed on me.

635
00:27:53,424 --> 00:27:56,194
You're saying you blocked her,

636
00:27:56,194 --> 00:27:57,462
but what you did wasn't close to blocking.

637
00:27:58,763 --> 00:27:59,797
There's Shin Woo.

638
00:28:00,999 --> 00:28:02,300
But that isn't it.

639
00:28:02,300 --> 00:28:04,469
(Shin Woo passes by right then.)

640
00:28:05,136 --> 00:28:08,072
You may have a lot on your mind, but...

641
00:28:08,506 --> 00:28:10,241
That timing.

642
00:28:10,241 --> 00:28:11,476
Was he summoned or something?

643
00:28:11,776 --> 00:28:13,211
He must have kept looking for her.

644
00:28:16,381 --> 00:28:17,248
In the end,

645
00:28:18,883 --> 00:28:19,617
(Looks away)

646
00:28:19,617 --> 00:28:21,753
you'll have to decide for yourself.

647
00:28:23,988 --> 00:28:26,024
That's my final bit of nonsense.

648
00:28:27,191 --> 00:28:28,726
I didn't understand what I just said.

649
00:28:29,127 --> 00:28:31,195
You did well. Don't worry.

650
00:28:31,195 --> 00:28:33,398
Goodness, this is heartbreaking.

651
00:28:33,932 --> 00:28:35,466
- Isn't it heartbreaking?
- It really is.

652
00:28:35,466 --> 00:28:37,769
For four days,

653
00:28:37,769 --> 00:28:40,305
he devoted himself to her.

654
00:28:40,305 --> 00:28:42,140
Then, out of nowhere,

655
00:28:42,140 --> 00:28:43,975
he pretends not to see her.

656
00:28:43,975 --> 00:28:46,978
How did it reach the point of avoidance?

657
00:28:47,579 --> 00:28:50,648
(The day of the final choice arrives.)

658
00:28:50,949 --> 00:28:54,185
The day of the final choice is here.

659
00:28:54,185 --> 00:28:55,653
Everyone must be nervous.

660
00:28:56,254 --> 00:28:57,555
(Preparations at Jeong Yoon's lodging)

661
00:28:57,555 --> 00:28:58,990
(Knock, knock)

662
00:29:00,825 --> 00:29:02,327
Ms. Go, it's the last day.

663
00:29:05,263 --> 00:29:06,164
Coffee.

664
00:29:06,698 --> 00:29:09,834
(In Kwon brings her coffee again.)

665
00:29:10,068 --> 00:29:11,302
He should do his very best.

666
00:29:11,302 --> 00:29:13,104
Yes, as much as he can.

667
00:29:14,806 --> 00:29:18,543
Will no one choose In Kwon, then?

668
00:29:18,543 --> 00:29:19,544
That's possible.

669
00:29:19,544 --> 00:29:20,678
Jeong Yoon...

670
00:29:23,014 --> 00:29:24,949
looks good with Ye Chan too.

671
00:29:24,949 --> 00:29:26,084
That's right.

672
00:29:26,084 --> 00:29:28,853
Her mother would choose Ye Chan.

673
00:29:29,454 --> 00:29:31,823
So this could...

674
00:29:31,823 --> 00:29:33,424
I think there will be one final couple.

675
00:29:34,192 --> 00:29:36,594
Ha Yoon may choose him.

676
00:29:36,594 --> 00:29:39,631
- Right.
- Ha Yoon may choose him.

677
00:29:39,631 --> 00:29:40,665
But her mother...

678
00:29:40,665 --> 00:29:43,501
Her mother may not show up.

679
00:29:43,501 --> 00:29:45,703
Her mother may convince her not to go.

680
00:29:45,703 --> 00:29:47,338
"Ha Yoon, don't go."

681
00:29:47,338 --> 00:29:50,008
Right, but Ha Yoon...

682
00:29:50,375 --> 00:29:52,243
There could be another twist.

683
00:29:52,243 --> 00:29:53,244
No?

684
00:29:53,878 --> 00:29:55,013
Hello.

685
00:29:55,013 --> 00:29:56,214
(Dong Young visits Ha Yoon's lodging.)

686
00:29:56,648 --> 00:29:57,682
I'll carry that for you.

687
00:29:58,416 --> 00:29:59,417
Are you done?

688
00:29:59,417 --> 00:30:00,752
Yes, I'm all packed.

689
00:30:01,085 --> 00:30:02,554
Thank you, Dong Young.

690
00:30:04,122 --> 00:30:05,757
How sweet.

691
00:30:05,757 --> 00:30:07,458
Little gestures like that...

692
00:30:08,393 --> 00:30:09,761
could win her back.

693
00:30:09,761 --> 00:30:10,795
For a little extra flair,

694
00:30:10,795 --> 00:30:12,597
shouldn't he have carried both?

695
00:30:13,398 --> 00:30:14,899
- Show his strength.
- One in his teeth.

696
00:30:14,899 --> 00:30:16,935
Instead of dragging them.

697
00:30:20,171 --> 00:30:21,072
Here.

698
00:30:21,072 --> 00:30:21,873
Okay.

699
00:30:23,274 --> 00:30:25,743
They look like newlyweds on a honeymoon.

700
00:30:25,743 --> 00:30:27,645
- Black and white.
- Their outfits.

701
00:30:28,413 --> 00:30:30,215
- They're from the introduction day.
- Yes.

702
00:30:30,215 --> 00:30:31,816
- Is it your uniform?
- Yes.

703
00:30:34,419 --> 00:30:35,987
Have you thought about it?

704
00:30:35,987 --> 00:30:37,422
Thought about it? More than I expected...

705
00:30:37,422 --> 00:30:40,225
Our mothers talked yesterday.

706
00:30:40,225 --> 00:30:41,025
Yes.

707
00:30:41,659 --> 00:30:45,530
I didn't hear
about their full conversation.

708
00:30:46,965 --> 00:30:50,635
Mom's face gave it away, so I stopped her.

709
00:30:51,970 --> 00:30:53,037
Is your mother all right?

710
00:30:55,573 --> 00:30:57,909
I love seeing her smile brightly.

711
00:31:01,012 --> 00:31:02,380
Ha Yoon, the thing is,

712
00:31:04,382 --> 00:31:07,785
wherever I can make an effort,

713
00:31:08,887 --> 00:31:13,057
I want to do my best even after we leave.

714
00:31:13,625 --> 00:31:14,492
Yes.

715
00:31:15,059 --> 00:31:15,994
And if we have time...

716
00:31:16,394 --> 00:31:19,597
to get to know each other,

717
00:31:19,597 --> 00:31:21,799
I'd like us to do that.

718
00:31:21,799 --> 00:31:23,034
That's what I wanted to say.

719
00:31:23,835 --> 00:31:25,270
So...

720
00:31:25,536 --> 00:31:26,504
I...

721
00:31:28,373 --> 00:31:29,607
am choosing you in the final choice.

722
00:31:30,542 --> 00:31:31,709
I'm choosing you in the final choice.

723
00:31:34,579 --> 00:31:37,882
That thrilled her. It shows.

724
00:31:39,717 --> 00:31:43,288
Whatever I can do...

725
00:31:43,288 --> 00:31:44,789
You're truly...

726
00:31:44,789 --> 00:31:45,690
I'll do everything I can.

727
00:31:48,626 --> 00:31:49,861
I want to do my very best.

728
00:31:50,895 --> 00:31:51,896
I don't want any regrets.

729
00:31:55,133 --> 00:31:56,200
That's so like you.

730
00:31:57,602 --> 00:31:58,670
Goodness.

731
00:31:59,671 --> 00:32:01,739
Perfect weather for the final choice.

732
00:32:02,840 --> 00:32:04,142
Did you prepare that line?

733
00:32:04,142 --> 00:32:05,109
No.

734
00:32:05,710 --> 00:32:08,479
Seriously, that line...

735
00:32:08,479 --> 00:32:09,614
What kind of weather is it?

736
00:32:10,582 --> 00:32:12,250
I think Ha Yoon will choose him.

737
00:32:13,318 --> 00:32:15,153
Even if her mother doesn't,

738
00:32:15,153 --> 00:32:18,456
I have a feeling she will.

739
00:32:19,257 --> 00:32:20,592
I...

740
00:32:20,992 --> 00:32:22,527
don't think she'll choose him.

741
00:32:22,527 --> 00:32:27,232
Why would she
if her mother opposes it so much?

742
00:32:28,299 --> 00:32:30,301
Does she drink lattes?

743
00:32:32,870 --> 00:32:34,205
Ms. Lee, could we...

744
00:32:35,340 --> 00:32:37,275
talk for just ten minutes?

745
00:32:37,275 --> 00:32:38,276
Yes, sure.

746
00:32:38,610 --> 00:32:39,911
Have a seat here.

747
00:32:39,911 --> 00:32:41,045
One moment.

748
00:32:41,045 --> 00:32:44,048
I always come prepared.

749
00:32:45,283 --> 00:32:48,119
- There's lots of pine pollen.
- Right.

750
00:32:50,755 --> 00:32:53,124
Yesterday must have been hard
for your mother too...

751
00:32:53,124 --> 00:32:54,425
after meeting Da Hye.

752
00:32:55,126 --> 00:32:57,795
Da Hye was really upset,

753
00:32:57,795 --> 00:33:01,432
so my mother was really worried too.

754
00:33:01,699 --> 00:33:05,703
The religion and dog issues bothered me.

755
00:33:05,703 --> 00:33:08,373
There was nothing else.

756
00:33:08,373 --> 00:33:10,842
Religion was the most important issue.

757
00:33:10,842 --> 00:33:12,644
As I got to know Da Hye,

758
00:33:12,644 --> 00:33:14,913
I became curious.

759
00:33:14,913 --> 00:33:17,849
I like Da Hye...

760
00:33:17,849 --> 00:33:20,552
so very much.

761
00:33:20,552 --> 00:33:24,289
Whenever I see her, I wonder...

762
00:33:24,289 --> 00:33:27,525
what life made her so warmhearted...

763
00:33:27,525 --> 00:33:30,328
and so kind in the way she speaks.

764
00:33:30,328 --> 00:33:33,164
Da Hye is beautiful beyond words.

765
00:33:33,164 --> 00:33:34,265
Thank you.

766
00:33:35,099 --> 00:33:37,368
That made me curious.

767
00:33:37,368 --> 00:33:40,038
I wanted to be like her and felt drawn in.

768
00:33:41,306 --> 00:33:43,875
Da Hye said she prayed...

769
00:33:43,875 --> 00:33:45,910
after meeting me too.

770
00:33:45,910 --> 00:33:48,213
Da Hye prayed so beautifully.

771
00:33:48,213 --> 00:33:50,682
That may be partly what moved my heart.

772
00:33:50,682 --> 00:33:53,051
It made me curious about prayer's power.

773
00:33:53,751 --> 00:33:55,153
So truly,

774
00:33:55,153 --> 00:33:57,288
I've leaned a lot.

775
00:33:57,288 --> 00:33:58,122
You're quite certain.

776
00:33:58,122 --> 00:34:01,759
I'm adjusting myself to Da Hye.

777
00:34:02,260 --> 00:34:04,295
I'm not changing her. I'm following her.

778
00:34:04,295 --> 00:34:05,930
My heart moved...

779
00:34:06,464 --> 00:34:08,566
toward hers.

780
00:34:08,566 --> 00:34:09,901
- That much?
- Yes.

781
00:34:09,901 --> 00:34:12,437
I've thought about it that deeply.

782
00:34:13,137 --> 00:34:15,640
I'm also highly capable,

783
00:34:15,640 --> 00:34:16,774
so I'm confident, Ms. Lee.

784
00:34:19,410 --> 00:34:21,179
(Rummaging)

785
00:34:21,179 --> 00:34:22,513
(Business card)

786
00:34:22,513 --> 00:34:24,282
This is the kind of man I am.

787
00:34:26,351 --> 00:34:28,386
I run a Korean medicine clinic.

788
00:34:28,386 --> 00:34:31,789
It's doing well, so I can provide.

789
00:34:31,789 --> 00:34:33,324
Thank you. I'll put this away for now.

790
00:34:33,324 --> 00:34:34,859
- You're the first to get one.
- Thanks.

791
00:34:35,193 --> 00:34:36,494
It's a brand-new business card.

792
00:34:37,362 --> 00:34:38,897
I haven't given one to anyone here.

793
00:34:39,564 --> 00:34:42,433
Thank you for expressing your feelings.

794
00:34:42,433 --> 00:34:44,068
Thank you for hearing me out.

795
00:34:44,068 --> 00:34:45,270
I'm truly grateful.

796
00:34:45,270 --> 00:34:48,273
There's time, so I'll think some more.

797
00:34:48,273 --> 00:34:50,575
Thank you for hearing me out, Ms. Lee.

798
00:34:50,575 --> 00:34:51,709
Let's go.

799
00:34:51,709 --> 00:34:53,945
He's making his case to the very end.

800
00:34:53,945 --> 00:34:55,280
He's truly doing everything he can.

801
00:34:55,280 --> 00:34:59,984
Even if it doesn't work out,

802
00:34:59,984 --> 00:35:04,656
he seems determined to have no regrets.

803
00:35:05,156 --> 00:35:06,324
Da Hye.

804
00:35:07,425 --> 00:35:09,661
Da Hye, come out for a moment.

805
00:35:09,661 --> 00:35:10,628
All right.

806
00:35:13,698 --> 00:35:15,533
Da Hye, would you like some coffee?

807
00:35:15,533 --> 00:35:16,501
- Sure.
- You haven't had any?

808
00:35:16,501 --> 00:35:17,835
- No, I haven't.
- I thought so.

809
00:35:17,835 --> 00:35:19,203
I bought an iced americano.

810
00:35:19,871 --> 00:35:22,674
First, I told your mother...

811
00:35:23,741 --> 00:35:27,445
about the concerns I had.

812
00:35:28,913 --> 00:35:30,815
Some things,

813
00:35:30,815 --> 00:35:34,152
honestly, still aren't fully resolved.

814
00:35:34,152 --> 00:35:36,554
And I realized something.

815
00:35:36,554 --> 00:35:38,156
My focus kept being on...

816
00:35:38,156 --> 00:35:41,326
all the things you did for me.

817
00:35:41,326 --> 00:35:43,561
Honestly, I remember them all.

818
00:35:43,561 --> 00:35:44,762
The way you...

819
00:35:45,830 --> 00:35:47,665
Sorry. I'll do it.

820
00:35:48,700 --> 00:35:50,935
The way you...

821
00:35:50,935 --> 00:35:53,404
expressed yourself so directly...

822
00:35:53,404 --> 00:35:55,206
made me grateful at first.

823
00:35:55,206 --> 00:35:58,276
But there is someone I somewhat like...

824
00:35:58,276 --> 00:36:03,014
and someone I want to talk to more.

825
00:36:03,414 --> 00:36:07,652
Things moved too fast to read my feelings.

826
00:36:07,652 --> 00:36:09,153
And...

827
00:36:09,153 --> 00:36:10,755
she kept saying, "Don't feel pressured,"

828
00:36:10,755 --> 00:36:13,524
- but honestly, I did.
- Of course.

829
00:36:13,892 --> 00:36:15,326
I...

830
00:36:15,326 --> 00:36:18,396
I'm not saying this
to make you uncomfortable.

831
00:36:19,030 --> 00:36:20,531
But as time went on,

832
00:36:21,232 --> 00:36:24,669
I wanted us to share a life of faith.

833
00:36:27,305 --> 00:36:28,740
(Hangs his head)

834
00:36:28,740 --> 00:36:30,708
I need to meet that man.

835
00:36:31,543 --> 00:36:34,979
When Shin Woo has time, bring him on...

836
00:36:34,979 --> 00:36:36,814
"Ask Us Anything Fortune Teller."

837
00:36:36,814 --> 00:36:38,416
"Share a life of faith?"

838
00:36:38,416 --> 00:36:39,617
Flirting through faith.

839
00:36:40,852 --> 00:36:44,188
I never expected you to say that.

840
00:36:45,290 --> 00:36:49,928
You have such strong convictions too.

841
00:36:49,928 --> 00:36:53,031
I can tell what it took to say that.

842
00:36:54,132 --> 00:36:58,403
I need a little time alone to think,

843
00:36:58,836 --> 00:36:59,837
then I'll decide.

844
00:36:59,837 --> 00:37:03,107
And please remember...

845
00:37:03,107 --> 00:37:04,742
that all your feelings reached me.

846
00:37:04,742 --> 00:37:05,777
All right. Thank you.

847
00:37:08,346 --> 00:37:09,547
Do Yoon, I brought you coffee.

848
00:37:10,748 --> 00:37:11,749
Can we talk?

849
00:37:11,749 --> 00:37:12,717
Sure.

850
00:37:14,419 --> 00:37:17,222
Have you sorted out your thoughts?

851
00:37:17,722 --> 00:37:18,690
Yes, I have now.

852
00:37:18,690 --> 00:37:19,624
Really?

853
00:37:22,160 --> 00:37:25,330
But what do you think?
When you picture marriage,

854
00:37:25,330 --> 00:37:27,398
who honestly suits you better?

855
00:37:35,340 --> 00:37:36,808
I did realize something.

856
00:37:36,808 --> 00:37:39,310
This may not completely answer...

857
00:37:39,310 --> 00:37:41,079
the question you just asked.

858
00:37:41,846 --> 00:37:46,517
But joining such a close-knit family...

859
00:37:46,517 --> 00:37:50,421
and getting to know them,

860
00:37:50,421 --> 00:37:53,725
then becoming one family sounds fun.

861
00:37:54,125 --> 00:37:56,628
I realized that's something...

862
00:37:56,628 --> 00:38:00,064
worth considering in a marriage.

863
00:38:00,064 --> 00:38:02,700
I definitely realized that. I truly did.

864
00:38:02,700 --> 00:38:04,535
He may turn toward her.

865
00:38:04,836 --> 00:38:08,239
He could easily stop giving hope now.

866
00:38:08,239 --> 00:38:10,041
But he's always been like that.

867
00:38:10,041 --> 00:38:11,709
That's true, but...

868
00:38:11,709 --> 00:38:13,778
He always thinks in percentages.

869
00:38:13,778 --> 00:38:16,881
He may still be calculating them.

870
00:38:17,181 --> 00:38:19,250
But then there's...

871
00:38:19,250 --> 00:38:20,718
the age difference...

872
00:38:20,718 --> 00:38:22,854
and other practical concerns.

873
00:38:23,821 --> 00:38:25,990
Still, I think we'd make a good couple...

874
00:38:25,990 --> 00:38:27,358
when I picture us together.

875
00:38:27,358 --> 00:38:29,661
I'm just telling you how I feel.

876
00:38:30,562 --> 00:38:33,264
Yesterday, I even wore that outfit...

877
00:38:33,264 --> 00:38:36,100
you said looked pretty
at our family meeting.

878
00:38:36,100 --> 00:38:39,270
- I wore it on purpose.
- That's why.

879
00:38:40,371 --> 00:38:41,506
That's why I wore it.

880
00:38:42,073 --> 00:38:43,208
So...

881
00:38:43,208 --> 00:38:45,476
honestly, I can picture marrying you.

882
00:38:46,578 --> 00:38:49,781
I'm still sorting out my thoughts,

883
00:38:49,781 --> 00:38:51,416
but that's how I feel right now.

884
00:38:54,886 --> 00:38:57,121
All right. Give it some thought.

885
00:38:57,121 --> 00:38:58,590
- Think about it.
- I will.

886
00:38:59,857 --> 00:39:02,627
That's Gen Z boldness.

887
00:39:02,627 --> 00:39:04,495
Do Yoon is impressive.

888
00:39:04,495 --> 00:39:06,464
- She should give it her all.
- Exactly.

889
00:39:06,464 --> 00:39:08,299
If it doesn't work, then what?

890
00:39:08,299 --> 00:39:10,535
Will her salary be cut? What happens?

891
00:39:10,535 --> 00:39:12,537
- If it doesn't work, too bad.
- Exactly.

892
00:39:13,838 --> 00:39:14,806
Ms. Popular.

893
00:39:15,506 --> 00:39:17,075
(Seong Mo comes to see Jeong Yoon.)

894
00:39:17,075 --> 00:39:18,209
- Did you sleep well?
- This is hard.

895
00:39:18,910 --> 00:39:21,579
Have you more or less decided?

896
00:39:22,146 --> 00:39:24,182
This is driving me crazy.

897
00:39:24,182 --> 00:39:25,149
Why?

898
00:39:25,583 --> 00:39:29,487
I wanted to talk to your mother.

899
00:39:29,487 --> 00:39:31,789
She finds you a little intimidating.

900
00:39:31,789 --> 00:39:32,690
That's what I thought.

901
00:39:32,690 --> 00:39:36,561
Not negatively.
She hasn't talked to you, that's why.

902
00:39:36,561 --> 00:39:38,463
Your first impression is intimidating.

903
00:39:38,463 --> 00:39:40,498
I know. I kept smiling, though.

904
00:39:41,532 --> 00:39:43,134
Maybe your smile was too scary.

905
00:39:43,134 --> 00:39:44,936
You should've smiled more sweetly.

906
00:39:45,570 --> 00:39:47,639
How do I smile sweetly?

907
00:39:47,639 --> 00:39:49,741
Smile with your cheekbones.

908
00:39:49,741 --> 00:39:51,009
Don't smile with just your mouth.

909
00:39:51,009 --> 00:39:52,343
- Here?
- Yes.

910
00:39:52,343 --> 00:39:53,645
Smile with your eyes too.

911
00:39:53,645 --> 00:39:54,612
(Grins)

912
00:39:56,447 --> 00:39:58,049
If you only smile with your mouth...

913
00:39:58,750 --> 00:40:00,151
I'll teach you. Come to my academy.

914
00:40:00,151 --> 00:40:01,452
She invited him to her academy.

915
00:40:02,654 --> 00:40:04,923
She laughs the most...

916
00:40:04,923 --> 00:40:07,625
when she's with Seong Mo.

917
00:40:07,625 --> 00:40:09,561
- That's what I said.
- It's true.

918
00:40:09,561 --> 00:40:10,261
Right?

919
00:40:10,261 --> 00:40:15,934
No one else makes her laugh like that.

920
00:40:16,301 --> 00:40:18,169
I truly can't read Jeong Yoon.

921
00:40:18,169 --> 00:40:20,171
Her choice matters most now.

922
00:40:20,171 --> 00:40:22,073
Who do you think she'll choose?

923
00:40:22,073 --> 00:40:24,576
I hope it's Seong Mo.

924
00:40:24,576 --> 00:40:26,044
If we're talking odds,

925
00:40:26,578 --> 00:40:27,845
I think it's In Kwon.

926
00:40:29,881 --> 00:40:30,782
But...

927
00:40:31,950 --> 00:40:33,885
- I'll be bold.
- Be bold.

928
00:40:34,485 --> 00:40:36,588
I'm going with Moon Seong Mo.

929
00:40:36,588 --> 00:40:38,056
We're in the same boat.

930
00:40:38,056 --> 00:40:38,990
Why?

931
00:40:39,591 --> 00:40:40,592
I can't stop thinking about it.

932
00:40:40,592 --> 00:40:44,062
She's the one who mentioned dopamine.

933
00:40:44,062 --> 00:40:45,863
Ultimately, I think...

934
00:40:45,863 --> 00:40:47,665
- Seong Mo?
- Seong Mo.

935
00:40:47,665 --> 00:40:49,968
Then I'll choose In Kwon.

936
00:40:49,968 --> 00:40:51,769
- No one picked Ye Chan.
- Right.

937
00:40:52,770 --> 00:40:53,705
At last.

938
00:40:53,705 --> 00:40:55,773
(Now, it's time for the final choice.)

939
00:40:56,274 --> 00:40:59,310
(The children choose first.)

940
00:40:59,477 --> 00:41:01,813
(The men have white roses.)

941
00:41:01,813 --> 00:41:04,082
(The women have red roses.)

942
00:41:04,983 --> 00:41:10,188
Give a rose to your final choice.

943
00:41:10,722 --> 00:41:13,057
But there's one important issue.

944
00:41:13,057 --> 00:41:17,795
On Match to Marry: With Parents 2,

945
00:41:17,795 --> 00:41:19,898
- a mutual choice isn't final.
- Right.

946
00:41:19,898 --> 00:41:23,768
Both mothers must approve...

947
00:41:23,768 --> 00:41:25,737
for them to become a final couple.

948
00:41:26,271 --> 00:41:29,841
(Who will the contestants choose?)

949
00:41:31,476 --> 00:41:34,712
The final choice begins now.

950
00:41:36,247 --> 00:41:38,416
Kim Dong Young will go first.

951
00:41:39,217 --> 00:41:40,184
At last.

952
00:41:42,921 --> 00:41:46,391
Thank you for the unforgettable memories.

953
00:41:46,891 --> 00:41:48,793
Until the very end,

954
00:41:49,427 --> 00:41:52,497
I'll set out to find my happiness.

955
00:42:03,408 --> 00:42:05,577
As expected, he chose Ha Yoon.

956
00:42:05,577 --> 00:42:06,511
That's right.

957
00:42:09,147 --> 00:42:12,283
I liked her the most here.

958
00:42:12,283 --> 00:42:14,152
My feelings haven't changed,

959
00:42:14,152 --> 00:42:16,921
and I still want to know her better.

960
00:42:16,921 --> 00:42:19,624
That's why I chose her.

961
00:42:20,792 --> 00:42:23,161
(Yang Ha Yoon's final choice)

962
00:42:23,161 --> 00:42:25,029
To me, this final choice meant...

963
00:42:25,029 --> 00:42:29,701
whether I could overcome the distance...

964
00:42:29,701 --> 00:42:33,938
and keep seeing Dong Young.

965
00:42:34,706 --> 00:42:35,807
And?

966
00:42:37,575 --> 00:42:41,679
What will Ha Yoon choose?

967
00:42:43,715 --> 00:42:45,149
It felt long,

968
00:42:45,149 --> 00:42:48,219
but the six days passed in an instant.

969
00:42:49,954 --> 00:42:53,591
What I learned here will help me...

970
00:42:56,194 --> 00:42:59,497
make good choices going forward.

971
00:43:04,035 --> 00:43:07,005
I will not make a final choice.

972
00:43:07,005 --> 00:43:08,406
My gosh.

973
00:43:08,406 --> 00:43:09,240
I told you.

974
00:43:15,413 --> 00:43:20,451
(Yang Ha Yoon makes no final choice.)

975
00:43:31,763 --> 00:43:34,499
Our time here was short,

976
00:43:35,600 --> 00:43:39,370
and my feelings weren't strong enough...

977
00:43:39,370 --> 00:43:41,673
to overcome an issue so important to me.

978
00:43:42,473 --> 00:43:46,277
So I decided not to choose anyone.

979
00:43:47,545 --> 00:43:50,148
During their final talk,

980
00:43:50,148 --> 00:43:51,482
her expression had already changed.

981
00:43:51,482 --> 00:43:53,685
She looked like a completely new person.

982
00:43:53,685 --> 00:43:57,188
Her feelings had faded.

983
00:43:57,188 --> 00:43:58,356
Poor Dong Young.

984
00:43:59,057 --> 00:44:00,558
Lee Kang Hyeon is next.

985
00:44:00,558 --> 00:44:02,660
Kang Hyeon.

986
00:44:02,660 --> 00:44:07,365
Meeting such wonderful people...

987
00:44:07,365 --> 00:44:09,467
made these six days truly meaningful.

988
00:44:10,301 --> 00:44:13,037
Most of all, this process...

989
00:44:13,037 --> 00:44:15,640
helped me learn who I am.

990
00:44:15,640 --> 00:44:17,942
That made this time worthwhile.

991
00:44:18,443 --> 00:44:21,045
I will not make a final choice.

992
00:44:25,250 --> 00:44:27,886
Everyone here is wonderful,

993
00:44:27,886 --> 00:44:30,955
but this was too little time...

994
00:44:30,955 --> 00:44:33,458
to explore our values and personalities.

995
00:44:33,825 --> 00:44:35,426
She worked hard.

996
00:44:35,426 --> 00:44:37,362
She did well through all of this.

997
00:44:37,362 --> 00:44:39,464
She'll meet someone wonderful.

998
00:44:40,365 --> 00:44:42,133
Kang Shin Woo is next.

999
00:44:43,101 --> 00:44:48,973
My parents always tell me this...

1000
00:44:48,973 --> 00:44:50,375
about the woman I should marry.

1001
00:44:51,309 --> 00:44:53,811
No particular conditions matter.

1002
00:44:54,145 --> 00:44:57,582
Find someone warmhearted and kind.

1003
00:44:58,550 --> 00:45:00,852
Through this experience,

1004
00:45:01,586 --> 00:45:03,521
I believe I met someone like that.

1005
00:45:12,497 --> 00:45:14,832
- We expected this.
- As expected.

1006
00:45:14,832 --> 00:45:17,602
It's too obvious to even predict.

1007
00:45:17,602 --> 00:45:18,670
He chose Da Hye.

1008
00:45:21,973 --> 00:45:25,109
(Kim Da Hye's final choice)

1009
00:45:26,477 --> 00:45:29,514
Honestly, I don't know how I feel now.

1010
00:45:30,348 --> 00:45:32,951
I'm weighing religion, values,

1011
00:45:32,951 --> 00:45:35,820
and many other things.

1012
00:45:41,893 --> 00:45:45,763
It's hard to choose in so little time.

1013
00:45:46,598 --> 00:45:50,368
But remembering his sincere feelings,

1014
00:45:50,368 --> 00:45:52,003
I will make a choice.

1015
00:45:52,770 --> 00:45:53,705
What?

1016
00:45:54,439 --> 00:45:55,740
She's choosing him?

1017
00:45:58,309 --> 00:46:01,913
(What will Kim Da Hye choose?)

1018
00:46:09,587 --> 00:46:10,388
What?

1019
00:46:11,823 --> 00:46:12,790
Seriously?

1020
00:46:13,625 --> 00:46:15,493
- Incredible.
- Is this real?

1021
00:46:16,027 --> 00:46:17,128
(Can't believe his eyes)

1022
00:46:17,128 --> 00:46:17,962
Incredible.

1023
00:46:19,163 --> 00:46:20,398
Goodness.

1024
00:46:22,100 --> 00:46:23,735
I'm extremely surprised.

1025
00:46:23,735 --> 00:46:25,536
Why did she choose him?

1026
00:46:25,536 --> 00:46:26,971
Why the sudden change at the end?

1027
00:46:28,273 --> 00:46:32,210
(Kim Da Hye chooses Kang Shin Woo.)

1028
00:46:34,913 --> 00:46:37,415
- In Kwon is shocked.
- Everyone is.

1029
00:46:38,850 --> 00:46:42,186
(Kang Shin Woo and Kim Da Hye matched.)

1030
00:46:42,186 --> 00:46:45,557
He took care of me in so many ways.

1031
00:46:45,557 --> 00:46:47,191
His feelings never changed.

1032
00:46:47,191 --> 00:46:50,595
I realized he truly cared about me.

1033
00:46:50,595 --> 00:46:51,763
When making my choice,

1034
00:46:52,463 --> 00:46:55,833
I decided to be a little braver.

1035
00:46:56,601 --> 00:46:59,137
This is very unexpected.

1036
00:46:59,137 --> 00:47:01,406
From Da Hye's perspective,

1037
00:47:02,540 --> 00:47:03,775
"He's that devoted to me?"

1038
00:47:03,775 --> 00:47:06,177
"After everything I did?"

1039
00:47:06,177 --> 00:47:09,314
She may have thought something like that.

1040
00:47:09,314 --> 00:47:12,083
Was it gratitude for his devotion?

1041
00:47:12,083 --> 00:47:13,384
That's right.

1042
00:47:13,384 --> 00:47:14,586
A gesture of appreciation.

1043
00:47:15,553 --> 00:47:18,957
(Ahn Do Yoon's final choice)

1044
00:47:18,957 --> 00:47:21,125
Before the final choice,

1045
00:47:21,125 --> 00:47:22,627
I'd already made my decision.

1046
00:47:23,528 --> 00:47:24,562
But...

1047
00:47:25,830 --> 00:47:27,966
it isn't over until it's over.

1048
00:47:28,466 --> 00:47:32,837
(What will Do Yoon choose?)

1049
00:47:36,441 --> 00:47:40,044
Over the past six days, I learned...

1050
00:47:40,044 --> 00:47:42,780
and grew so much as a person.

1051
00:47:42,780 --> 00:47:44,883
To my mom, who joined me here,

1052
00:47:45,617 --> 00:47:47,452
thank you. I love you so much.

1053
00:47:48,820 --> 00:47:51,422
I will make a final choice.

1054
00:47:52,357 --> 00:47:53,124
As expected.

1055
00:47:53,124 --> 00:47:54,726
- Really?
- That's bold.

1056
00:48:01,332 --> 00:48:03,468
- She chose Ye Chan.
- Right.

1057
00:48:03,468 --> 00:48:06,471
(Ahn Do Yoon chooses Kwon Ye Chan.)

1058
00:48:09,440 --> 00:48:12,210
Talking to Ye Chan made me like him more.

1059
00:48:12,210 --> 00:48:15,647
I look forward to our future chemistry.

1060
00:48:16,814 --> 00:48:19,117
Will her Gen Z boldness pay off?

1061
00:48:19,350 --> 00:48:22,086
I think it might work.

1062
00:48:22,086 --> 00:48:24,122
Their families get along well too.

1063
00:48:24,122 --> 00:48:25,456
Then maybe,

1064
00:48:25,456 --> 00:48:28,860
he'll make a huge reversal here...

1065
00:48:28,860 --> 00:48:30,128
and change course.

1066
00:48:30,762 --> 00:48:33,513
(Kwon Ye Chan's final choice)

1067
00:48:33,514 --> 00:48:37,351
Do Yoon grew prettier and more charming.

1068
00:48:37,351 --> 00:48:40,687
Jeong Yoon and I clearly communicate well.

1069
00:48:42,289 --> 00:48:46,293
Six days may seem short,

1070
00:48:46,293 --> 00:48:47,761
but it also felt quite long.

1071
00:48:48,562 --> 00:48:50,998
Now, whenever I see their faces,

1072
00:48:51,865 --> 00:48:53,534
I see their mothers' faces too.

1073
00:48:54,168 --> 00:48:56,737
It reminded me how precious they are.

1074
00:48:56,737 --> 00:48:59,406
That made me careful not to hurt them.

1075
00:49:01,041 --> 00:49:03,610
But these six days...

1076
00:49:03,610 --> 00:49:06,513
were somewhat too short...

1077
00:49:06,513 --> 00:49:08,348
for me to make a final choice now.

1078
00:49:09,783 --> 00:49:11,251
I gave it a lot of thought,

1079
00:49:11,251 --> 00:49:12,219
but at this point,

1080
00:49:14,855 --> 00:49:17,191
I will not make a final choice.

1081
00:49:18,225 --> 00:49:19,426
Goodness.

1082
00:49:22,329 --> 00:49:24,565
I will not make a final choice.

1083
00:49:32,272 --> 00:49:36,977
(Kwon Ye Chan makes no final choice.)

1084
00:49:37,177 --> 00:49:39,113
I do feel drawn...

1085
00:49:39,113 --> 00:49:40,981
to both Do Yoon and Jeong Yoon.

1086
00:49:41,248 --> 00:49:44,952
But I don't feel a true spark yet.

1087
00:49:44,952 --> 00:49:46,653
So I've decided not to choose now...

1088
00:49:46,653 --> 00:49:49,623
and to talk more casually outside.

1089
00:49:50,224 --> 00:49:51,325
Wait a minute.

1090
00:49:51,325 --> 00:49:52,826
If this was what he'd do,

1091
00:49:53,360 --> 00:49:55,396
why did he do that for six days?

1092
00:49:55,396 --> 00:49:57,264
Why go around everywhere...

1093
00:49:57,264 --> 00:50:01,201
Even taking notes and analyzing them?

1094
00:50:01,201 --> 00:50:02,469
Who cares if it doesn't work out?

1095
00:50:02,469 --> 00:50:04,304
Exactly. Then it doesn't work out.

1096
00:50:04,304 --> 00:50:07,708
Will his salary be cut or something?

1097
00:50:07,708 --> 00:50:08,709
Jang Hoon is very angry.

1098
00:50:08,709 --> 00:50:10,043
What does that make us, then?

1099
00:50:10,043 --> 00:50:11,378
He's really angry.

1100
00:50:11,378 --> 00:50:13,013
Exactly.

1101
00:50:13,013 --> 00:50:14,081
This feels pointless.

1102
00:50:14,081 --> 00:50:15,115
It truly does.

1103
00:50:16,049 --> 00:50:18,218
Lee In Kwon is next.

1104
00:50:18,218 --> 00:50:19,620
Then...

1105
00:50:19,620 --> 00:50:21,622
- It's down to two.
- One rival is out.

1106
00:50:22,423 --> 00:50:24,992
Honestly, I don't know what I want.

1107
00:50:24,992 --> 00:50:29,329
I don't want to tie myself in knots...

1108
00:50:29,329 --> 00:50:32,066
just to beg for someone to choose me.

1109
00:50:32,066 --> 00:50:34,468
That's why I keep going back and forth.

1110
00:50:36,170 --> 00:50:37,104
What is he saying?

1111
00:50:38,305 --> 00:50:40,507
Let's just go for it.

1112
00:50:40,507 --> 00:50:41,508
He'll choose her.

1113
00:50:41,508 --> 00:50:44,912
His odds just jumped to 50 percent.

1114
00:50:44,912 --> 00:50:46,080
The lawyer is out.

1115
00:50:47,748 --> 00:50:49,783
During my time with everyone,

1116
00:50:50,250 --> 00:50:51,885
I learned that giving my heart...

1117
00:50:52,553 --> 00:50:54,655
and receiving another's heart...

1118
00:50:55,622 --> 00:50:58,459
are both truly a big deal.

1119
00:50:59,660 --> 00:51:01,929
I hope the pain I felt here...

1120
00:51:02,963 --> 00:51:06,967
leads me to an even better partner...

1121
00:51:06,967 --> 00:51:08,969
and a better connection.

1122
00:51:10,003 --> 00:51:12,005
That sounds like he won't choose anyone.

1123
00:51:15,709 --> 00:51:19,246
(What will Lee In Kwon choose?)

1124
00:51:23,083 --> 00:51:24,718
He isn't going to the basket
to quit, is he?

1125
00:51:31,225 --> 00:51:32,359
There he goes.

1126
00:51:32,926 --> 00:51:34,361
Why did he make it
so confusing with that remark?

1127
00:51:34,361 --> 00:51:35,596
He did make it confusing.

1128
00:51:35,596 --> 00:51:37,030
(Lee In Kwon chooses Choi Jeong Yoon.)

1129
00:51:44,838 --> 00:51:47,107
I want to see Jeong Yoon outside.

1130
00:51:47,975 --> 00:51:50,978
I've never gone this far in my life.

1131
00:51:50,978 --> 00:51:54,548
I need to see
what's beyond the finish line.

1132
00:51:59,153 --> 00:52:02,356
(Moon Seong Mo's final choice)

1133
00:52:02,623 --> 00:52:06,894
These six days were filled with emotions.

1134
00:52:10,230 --> 00:52:13,200
I hope the feelings...

1135
00:52:14,168 --> 00:52:20,140
behind my final choice were not mistaken.

1136
00:52:27,281 --> 00:52:28,348
He should go for it.

1137
00:52:28,348 --> 00:52:31,585
- He should.
- A surprise contender.

1138
00:52:31,585 --> 00:52:32,619
He should go for it.

1139
00:52:36,490 --> 00:52:39,460
Jeong Yoon and I communicate best.

1140
00:52:39,460 --> 00:52:41,795
She lives closest and is the prettiest.

1141
00:52:41,795 --> 00:52:43,797
I wanted to express my feelings.

1142
00:52:45,399 --> 00:52:49,036
(Jeong Yoon was chosen
by In Kwon and Seong Mo.)

1143
00:52:49,036 --> 00:52:50,437
I'm nervous.

1144
00:52:50,437 --> 00:52:51,338
Now,

1145
00:52:51,972 --> 00:52:56,643
only Jeong Yoon's choice remains.

1146
00:52:57,811 --> 00:53:01,248
(Choi Jeong Yoon's final choice)

1147
00:53:01,248 --> 00:53:03,016
It was short,

1148
00:53:03,016 --> 00:53:06,987
but these six days were very fulfilling.

1149
00:53:06,987 --> 00:53:09,690
There were many difficult moments,

1150
00:53:10,891 --> 00:53:14,895
but wonderful people made me happy.

1151
00:53:17,197 --> 00:53:21,402
I hope to continue the connections...

1152
00:53:21,402 --> 00:53:24,405
I made with the people here.

1153
00:53:27,074 --> 00:53:28,008
What does that mean?

1154
00:53:29,476 --> 00:53:30,611
- That's vague.
- What will she do?

1155
00:53:30,944 --> 00:53:34,148
(What is Jeong Yoon's final choice?)

1156
00:53:35,315 --> 00:53:36,150
She's going.

1157
00:53:37,084 --> 00:53:39,520
- Her direction...
- Which direction?

1158
00:53:39,520 --> 00:53:42,122
- She's headed that way.
- Where?

1159
00:53:42,122 --> 00:53:44,024
She's headed that way.

1160
00:53:46,660 --> 00:53:49,563
(Past Seong Mo)

1161
00:53:49,563 --> 00:53:53,500
(Where is Jeong Yoon going?)

1162
00:53:57,504 --> 00:53:58,972
(Choi Jeong Yoon chooses Lee In Kwon.)

1163
00:53:58,972 --> 00:54:01,141
Yes, that's it.

1164
00:54:01,141 --> 00:54:02,176
(Lee Yo Won's prediction was right.)

1165
00:54:02,176 --> 00:54:04,278
I knew it. I knew this would happen.

1166
00:54:04,278 --> 00:54:05,879
- They look good together.
- They do.

1167
00:54:05,879 --> 00:54:07,281
- They're a beautiful couple.
- Right.

1168
00:54:08,415 --> 00:54:12,186
(Lee In Kwon and Choi Jeong Yoon matched.)

1169
00:54:18,892 --> 00:54:20,728
To me, In Kwon always seemed...

1170
00:54:20,728 --> 00:54:24,131
to be one step ahead.

1171
00:54:24,131 --> 00:54:28,335
He always came first and cared for me.

1172
00:54:28,335 --> 00:54:32,473
I want to talk to him
and spend time with him outside.

1173
00:54:32,473 --> 00:54:34,174
That's why I chose him.

1174
00:54:36,110 --> 00:54:37,644
I truly didn't expect this.

1175
00:54:38,746 --> 00:54:39,780
You worked hard.

1176
00:54:42,382 --> 00:54:46,186
(Two matches among the contestants)

1177
00:54:46,186 --> 00:54:47,721
But it isn't over yet.

1178
00:54:47,721 --> 00:54:50,057
What do you predict the mothers will do?

1179
00:54:50,057 --> 00:54:54,061
In Kwon and Jeong Yoon should be fine.

1180
00:54:54,061 --> 00:54:56,063
Yes, I think they'll approve.

1181
00:54:56,063 --> 00:55:00,868
I think Da Hye's mother may object.

1182
00:55:00,868 --> 00:55:03,837
Shin Woo's mother
might not come out either.

1183
00:55:03,837 --> 00:55:05,205
But about that,

1184
00:55:05,205 --> 00:55:08,675
since she saw how desperate her son was,

1185
00:55:08,675 --> 00:55:09,443
Right.

1186
00:55:09,443 --> 00:55:12,679
she'll likely think there's no other way.

1187
00:55:14,181 --> 00:55:17,017
(The final hurdle to become a couple)

1188
00:55:17,384 --> 00:55:20,788
(The mothers' choice)

1189
00:55:21,955 --> 00:55:26,360
(The contestants wait outside the door.)

1190
00:55:29,463 --> 00:55:32,232
If the mothers approve,

1191
00:55:32,232 --> 00:55:33,834
they'll open the door and come in.

1192
00:55:33,834 --> 00:55:35,903
If they disapprove,

1193
00:55:35,903 --> 00:55:37,571
- they won't come in.
- Right.

1194
00:55:37,571 --> 00:55:40,441
(Will they open the door and enter?)

1195
00:55:40,707 --> 00:55:42,976
- Shin Woo and Da Hye.
- Yes.

1196
00:55:45,712 --> 00:55:47,047
The door is firmly shut.

1197
00:55:49,750 --> 00:55:50,617
It is.

1198
00:55:54,655 --> 00:55:57,357
What will their mothers choose?

1199
00:56:00,327 --> 00:56:01,795
Why does that gate feel so daunting?

1200
00:56:04,031 --> 00:56:07,501
Sometimes I struggle to read my mother.

1201
00:56:07,501 --> 00:56:09,570
This was one of those times.

1202
00:56:09,570 --> 00:56:12,673
She has an ideal son-in-law in mind.

1203
00:56:12,673 --> 00:56:14,708
I think she's debating it now.

1204
00:56:16,910 --> 00:56:18,245
What if no one comes?

1205
00:56:20,080 --> 00:56:24,418
(Will the mothers approve this match?)

1206
00:56:28,355 --> 00:56:29,323
The door opened.

1207
00:56:30,524 --> 00:56:33,894
(Kang Shin Woo's mother approves.)

1208
00:56:33,894 --> 00:56:35,863
- Shin Woo's mother.
- That's right.

1209
00:56:35,863 --> 00:56:36,864
- Shin Woo's mother.
- Of course.

1210
00:56:36,864 --> 00:56:38,365
She promised them.

1211
00:56:43,704 --> 00:56:45,339
- Thank you, Mother.
- Thank you.

1212
00:56:45,339 --> 00:56:47,574
Congratulations. Good job.

1213
00:56:47,574 --> 00:56:48,675
Thank you, Da Hye.

1214
00:56:48,675 --> 00:56:49,643
Not at all, Ms. Park.

1215
00:56:49,643 --> 00:56:51,145
Thank you for choosing my precious son.

1216
00:56:52,045 --> 00:56:53,847
He's your precious son.

1217
00:56:53,847 --> 00:56:56,650
You're a precious daughter too. Thank you.

1218
00:57:00,921 --> 00:57:02,823
I was so happy to see them together.

1219
00:57:02,823 --> 00:57:07,661
She's beautiful and kindhearted.

1220
00:57:07,661 --> 00:57:11,165
I'm so happy. This wonderful match came...

1221
00:57:11,165 --> 00:57:12,366
from Match to Marry: With Parents 2.

1222
00:57:14,701 --> 00:57:18,605
(And now, only one person remains.)

1223
00:57:18,605 --> 00:57:22,976
Now, only Da Hye's mother remains.

1224
00:57:24,211 --> 00:57:25,112
What will happen?

1225
00:57:26,046 --> 00:57:31,085
(Kim Da Hye's mother hesitates outside.)

1226
00:57:31,385 --> 00:57:32,753
Ms. Lee.

1227
00:57:34,054 --> 00:57:35,222
Yes.

1228
00:57:37,124 --> 00:57:38,625
What will happen?

1229
00:57:40,227 --> 00:57:43,130
Shin Woo and his mother
did all they possibly could.

1230
00:57:43,130 --> 00:57:45,532
They truly gave it their all.

1231
00:57:46,200 --> 00:57:47,801
My heart is pounding.

1232
00:57:47,801 --> 00:57:48,736
You?

1233
00:57:50,771 --> 00:57:52,406
Who could be more nervous than me?

1234
00:57:54,508 --> 00:57:55,743
Please.

1235
00:57:55,743 --> 00:57:58,541
(What will Kim Da Hye's mother choose?)

1236
00:58:02,401 --> 00:58:03,936
Kim Da Hye's mother...

1237
00:58:03,936 --> 00:58:06,138
did not approve her daughter's choice.

1238
00:58:08,340 --> 00:58:09,374
Goodness.

1239
00:58:10,142 --> 00:58:11,710
- I knew it.
- Yes.

1240
00:58:12,044 --> 00:58:14,279
(No twist in the final result)

1241
00:58:14,279 --> 00:58:15,647
Just as expected.

1242
00:58:17,182 --> 00:58:21,553
(Kim Da Hye's mother disapproves.)

1243
00:58:31,463 --> 00:58:36,769
(Kim Da Hye's mother turns away.)

1244
00:58:36,769 --> 00:58:40,539
At first, it was religion and the dog.

1245
00:58:41,673 --> 00:58:43,742
But Shin Woo was so persistent.

1246
00:58:43,742 --> 00:58:47,212
Because he liked Da Hye,

1247
00:58:47,212 --> 00:58:52,151
did he have to keep others from her?

1248
00:58:52,151 --> 00:58:55,487
So I couldn't open my heart to him.

1249
00:58:55,487 --> 00:58:56,789
That's how I felt.

1250
00:58:57,756 --> 00:58:59,124
I see.

1251
00:58:59,124 --> 00:59:02,394
It's a major misunderstanding. That's sad.

1252
00:59:02,394 --> 00:59:04,430
Other than jokingly saying,

1253
00:59:04,430 --> 00:59:06,765
"Don't go,"

1254
00:59:06,765 --> 00:59:08,834
he never actually stopped anyone.

1255
00:59:08,834 --> 00:59:09,535
That's right.

1256
00:59:09,535 --> 00:59:11,270
She seems to have misunderstood him.

1257
00:59:11,603 --> 00:59:14,807
Still, it's her and Da Hye's choice.

1258
00:59:14,807 --> 00:59:16,008
That's right.

1259
00:59:16,008 --> 00:59:18,777
- We must respect it.
- Of course.

1260
00:59:20,345 --> 00:59:23,315
I hope you won't
misunderstand her, Ms. Park.

1261
00:59:23,315 --> 00:59:27,052
I'm sure she had other reasons too.
I'll ask.

1262
00:59:27,052 --> 00:59:27,986
It's okay.

1263
00:59:27,986 --> 00:59:31,090
She must have agonized over it.

1264
00:59:31,090 --> 00:59:34,093
I can read the other mothers' feelings,

1265
00:59:34,093 --> 00:59:37,229
but I can never quite read my own mom.

1266
00:59:37,229 --> 00:59:38,864
It's okay. Thank you, Da Hye.

1267
00:59:39,998 --> 00:59:41,100
Thank you so much.

1268
00:59:44,303 --> 00:59:47,439
You know she doesn't dislike you, right?

1269
00:59:48,440 --> 00:59:49,608
I do.

1270
00:59:49,608 --> 00:59:51,543
I told her everything I could.

1271
00:59:51,543 --> 00:59:55,547
I didn't have enough time here...

1272
00:59:55,547 --> 01:00:01,153
to address all her concerns and worries.

1273
01:00:01,153 --> 01:00:03,522
Even if she disapproves now,

1274
01:00:03,522 --> 01:00:07,459
if I show her I'm steadfast over time,

1275
01:00:07,459 --> 01:00:10,095
maybe she'll change her mind one day.

1276
01:00:10,095 --> 01:00:11,597
That's what I thought.

1277
01:00:12,297 --> 01:00:17,369
Da Hye's mother must have agonized too.

1278
01:00:17,369 --> 01:00:20,873
Deep down, I'm disappointed.

1279
01:00:20,873 --> 01:00:22,374
But...

1280
01:00:22,374 --> 01:00:27,212
I decided to be grateful...

1281
01:00:27,212 --> 01:00:31,617
that Da Hye chose Shin Woo.

1282
01:00:32,251 --> 01:00:34,520
Because this concerns her child,

1283
01:00:34,520 --> 01:00:37,656
I kept wondering what decision...

1284
01:00:37,656 --> 01:00:40,159
a mother would reach. It was difficult.

1285
01:00:40,159 --> 01:00:42,594
I haven't raised children myself yet.

1286
01:00:42,594 --> 01:00:45,297
But I have no regrets.

1287
01:00:45,297 --> 01:00:46,398
This won't end here.

1288
01:00:46,398 --> 01:00:49,034
I'm certain we'll meet outside,

1289
01:00:49,034 --> 01:00:51,804
see each other, and keep talking.

1290
01:00:51,804 --> 01:00:53,806
So I don't feel too disappointed.

1291
01:00:55,107 --> 01:00:56,041
With that...

1292
01:00:56,041 --> 01:00:59,044
They failed to become a final couple.

1293
01:00:59,044 --> 01:01:03,015
There will be many chances to meet...

1294
01:01:03,015 --> 01:01:04,883
another wonderful person.

1295
01:01:04,883 --> 01:01:06,552
Absolutely. There certainly will be.

1296
01:01:07,653 --> 01:01:10,355
Next are In Kwon and Jeong Yoon.

1297
01:01:12,224 --> 01:01:13,225
They'll come.

1298
01:01:14,126 --> 01:01:16,862
I don't expect any surprises from them.

1299
01:01:16,862 --> 01:01:17,863
And...

1300
01:01:18,831 --> 01:01:22,134
But these two mothers...

1301
01:01:22,935 --> 01:01:24,403
were very easygoing.

1302
01:01:24,403 --> 01:01:25,838
They have no special reason to object.

1303
01:01:25,838 --> 01:01:29,608
There simply isn't much to oppose.

1304
01:01:30,375 --> 01:01:34,279
(What will the two mothers choose?)

1305
01:01:38,751 --> 01:01:40,853
- In Kwon's mother.
- His mother.

1306
01:01:40,853 --> 01:01:42,955
- Of course, she approves.
- Right.

1307
01:01:49,762 --> 01:01:51,697
Jeong Yoon, you're so beautiful.

1308
01:01:51,697 --> 01:01:52,631
Hello.

1309
01:01:52,631 --> 01:01:54,466
You look so beautiful, Jeong Yoon.

1310
01:01:56,168 --> 01:01:57,736
Thank you for making the trip.

1311
01:01:57,736 --> 01:01:58,704
Thank you.

1312
01:01:59,571 --> 01:02:02,908
- You worked hard.
- So did you, Mom.

1313
01:02:03,942 --> 01:02:06,845
I got choked up on the way here.

1314
01:02:06,845 --> 01:02:07,846
Did you?

1315
01:02:07,846 --> 01:02:09,748
- This whole thing.
- Of course.

1316
01:02:10,482 --> 01:02:13,485
Naturally, I applaud and support them.

1317
01:02:14,620 --> 01:02:17,356
The more I saw and spoke to her,

1318
01:02:17,356 --> 01:02:19,558
the more wonderful Jeong Yoon seemed.

1319
01:02:19,558 --> 01:02:21,894
I'm extremely grateful.

1320
01:02:22,694 --> 01:02:24,997
From zero votes all the way here.

1321
01:02:28,133 --> 01:02:29,301
But her mother...

1322
01:02:32,538 --> 01:02:38,444
(Only Jeong Yoon's mother remains.)

1323
01:02:40,579 --> 01:02:43,348
She struggled so much until yesterday.

1324
01:02:44,683 --> 01:02:47,686
At the end, she met Ye Chan...

1325
01:02:48,187 --> 01:02:49,722
- for the final meeting.
- That's right.

1326
01:02:49,722 --> 01:02:52,324
That does worry me a little.

1327
01:02:55,060 --> 01:02:59,965
(What will Jeong Yoon's mother choose?)

1328
01:03:03,969 --> 01:03:04,903
What?

1329
01:03:10,609 --> 01:03:12,177
Of course, she has to come out.

1330
01:03:12,177 --> 01:03:13,645
(Choi Jeong Yoon's mother approves.)

1331
01:03:13,645 --> 01:03:14,680
Congratulations.

1332
01:03:14,680 --> 01:03:16,482
Congratulations.

1333
01:03:17,483 --> 01:03:20,719
(She approves Jeong Yoon and In Kwon.)

1334
01:03:21,086 --> 01:03:22,988
(Clap, clap)

1335
01:03:37,236 --> 01:03:39,104
I will support them unconditionally.

1336
01:03:40,038 --> 01:03:43,375
He brought her coffee on the last day.

1337
01:03:43,375 --> 01:03:45,444
He also checked if she'd packed...

1338
01:03:45,444 --> 01:03:47,713
and came to carry her bags.

1339
01:03:47,713 --> 01:03:51,517
Seeing such thoughtfulness, I'm grateful.

1340
01:03:51,517 --> 01:03:54,620
Now, I'll trust Jeong Yoon's choice...

1341
01:03:54,620 --> 01:03:58,357
and simply support her from the sidelines.

1342
01:03:58,357 --> 01:04:00,726
I learned that during these six days.

1343
01:04:01,460 --> 01:04:03,796
Go bring her mother here.

1344
01:04:03,796 --> 01:04:04,763
Thank you.

1345
01:04:07,833 --> 01:04:09,468
Thank you so much.

1346
01:04:10,903 --> 01:04:12,971
You went through so much.

1347
01:04:12,971 --> 01:04:14,473
- Thank you so much.
- Not at all.

1348
01:04:17,943 --> 01:04:21,213
I'm still dazed. It doesn't feel real.

1349
01:04:21,213 --> 01:04:23,382
I want to see him outside again soon.

1350
01:04:25,484 --> 01:04:26,452
I'm so happy.

1351
01:04:28,053 --> 01:04:30,823
I believe they made a good choice.

1352
01:04:30,823 --> 01:04:33,826
I want to thank her for choosing me...

1353
01:04:33,826 --> 01:04:37,463
and say coffee is always on me.

1354
01:04:38,163 --> 01:04:40,432
You worked so hard...

1355
01:04:40,432 --> 01:04:41,967
to find such a lovely partner.

1356
01:04:43,502 --> 01:04:44,870
Thank you so much.

1357
01:04:45,370 --> 01:04:46,772
Please take good care of her.

1358
01:04:48,140 --> 01:04:51,844
Congratulations to In Kwon and Jeong Yoon.

1359
01:04:51,844 --> 01:04:54,279
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

1360
01:04:55,013 --> 01:04:56,482
If they marry, maybe they'll appear...

1361
01:04:56,482 --> 01:04:59,651
on "Same Bed, Different Dreams."

1362
